msgstr "Abrir los ajustes de COSMIC"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/accent.rs rust/rexon-core/src/animations.rs
#: rust/rexon-core/src/screen_effects.rs
msgid "The program %1 is not installed."
msgstr "La aplicación %1 no está instalada."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/accent.rs
msgid "Could not read %1."
msgstr "No se ha podido leer %1."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/accent.rs rust/rexon-core/src/animations.rs
msgid "Could not write %1."
msgstr "No se ha podido escribir %1."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/accent.rs
msgid ""
"Couldn't take a color from the wallpaper: the desktop has no picture "
"wallpaper right now."
msgstr ""
"No se ha podido tomar el color del fondo de pantalla: ahora mismo el "
"escritorio no tiene una imagen de fondo."

#. TRANSLATORS: %1 is the technical reason.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/accent.rs
msgid "Couldn't apply the accent color: %1"
msgstr "No se ha podido aplicar el color de acento: %1"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/accent.rs
msgid "Couldn't save the accent color: %1 could not be written."
msgstr "No se ha podido guardar el color de acento: no se ha escrito %1."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/accent.rs
msgid "Accent color applied."
msgstr "Color de acento aplicado."

#. TRANSLATORS: %1 is a color name such as “blue”.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/accent.rs
msgid "GTK 4 apps got the closest GNOME accent color: %1."
msgstr ""
"Las aplicaciones GTK 4 han recibido el color de acento de GNOME más "
"parecido: %1."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/accent.rs
msgid "Pantheon takes its accent color from the wallpaper itself."
msgstr "Pantheon toma el color de acento del fondo de pantalla por sí mismo."

#. TRANSLATORS: %1 is a color name such as “mint”.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/accent.rs
msgid "Pantheon got the closest elementary accent color: %1."
msgstr ""
"Pantheon ha recibido el color de acento de elementary más parecido: %1."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/accent.rs
msgid "COSMIC rebuilt its theme with the accent color."
msgstr "COSMIC ha regenerado su tema con este color de acento."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/accent.rs
msgid "Deepin got the accent color."
msgstr "Deepin ha recibido el color de acento."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/accent.rs
msgid "LXQt and its Qt apps got it."
msgstr "LXQt y sus aplicaciones Qt lo han recibido."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/accent.rs
msgid "The border of the active window in %1 got it."
msgstr "El borde de la ventana activa en %1 ha recibido este color."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/accent.rs
msgid ""
"KDE and Qt apps got it; apps that are already open pick it up after a "
"restart."
msgstr ""
"Las aplicaciones de KDE y Qt lo han recibido; las que ya están abiertas lo "
"aplicarán tras reiniciarse."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/accent.rs
msgid "Nothing to return: Rexon has not changed the accent color."
msgstr "No hay nada que restaurar: Rexon no ha cambiado el color de acento."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/accent.rs
msgid "Couldn't return the accent color: %1"
msgstr "No se ha podido restaurar el color de acento: %1"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/accent.rs
msgid "The accent color is back as it was before Rexon."
msgstr "El color de acento ha vuelto al que había antes de Rexon."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/accent.rs
msgid "Couldn't apply the accent color: unknown color."
msgstr "No se ha podido aplicar el color de acento: color desconocido."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/aeroshell.rs
msgid "Repair Isn't Possible Yet"
msgstr "Todavía no se puede reparar"

#. TRANSLATORS: %1 is the new Plasma version (e.g. 6.8), %2 the version
#. the AeroThemePlasma authors currently have (e.g. 6.7.5).
#: rust/rexon-core/src/aeroshell.rs
msgid ""
"Rebuilding the appearance won't help yet: the AeroThemePlasma authors "
"haven't caught up with Plasma %1 (their version is still %2). A rebuild now "
"would produce the same broken result.\n"
"\n"
"Rexon will check again on the next start and offer the repair as soon as "
"their update is out."
msgstr ""
"Recompilar la apariencia no servirá de nada por ahora: los autores de "
"AeroThemePlasma aún no se han puesto al día con Plasma %1 (de momento tienen "
"%2). Recompilar ahora daría el mismo resultado roto.\n"
"\n"
"Rexon volverá a comprobarlo en el próximo inicio y te ofrecerá la reparación "
"en cuanto publiquen una actualización."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/aeroshell.rs rust/rexon-core/src/update_guard.rs
msgid "Don't Update the System Yet"
msgstr "No actualices el sistema"

#. TRANSLATORS: %1 is the new Plasma version waiting in the repositories
#. (e.g. 6.8), %2 the newest Plasma that AeroThemePlasma supports (e.g. 6.7).
#: rust/rexon-core/src/aeroshell.rs
msgid ""
"Plasma %1 is out, but AeroThemePlasma supports only Plasma %2 so far. After "
"the update, the Start menu and the taskbar will disappear.\n"
"\n"
"Wait until the AeroThemePlasma authors release a version for Plasma %1 — "
"then it is safe to update."
msgstr ""
"Ha salido Plasma %1, pero AeroThemePlasma de momento solo es compatible con "
"Plasma %2. Tras actualizar desaparecerán el menú «Inicio» y la barra de "
"tareas.\n"
"\n"
"Espera a que los autores de AeroThemePlasma publiquen una versión para "
"Plasma %1; entonces podrás actualizar con seguridad."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/aeroshell.rs
msgid "A Plasma Update Is Waiting"
msgstr "Actualización de Plasma pendiente"

#. TRANSLATORS: %1 is the Plasma version waiting in the repositories (e.g. 6.7.5).
#: rust/rexon-core/src/aeroshell.rs
msgid ""
"Plasma %1 is ready to install. After the update, the AeroThemePlasma window "
"effects will stay off until it is rebuilt for the new version — Rexon will "
"offer the rebuild right after the update."
msgstr ""
"Plasma %1 está lista para instalarse. Tras la actualización, los efectos de "
"ventana de AeroThemePlasma estarán desactivados hasta que se recompile para "
"la nueva versión; Rexon te ofrecerá recompilarla justo después de actualizar."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/aeroshell.rs
msgid "Leftover of AeroThemePlasma Found"
msgstr "Se ha encontrado un resto de AeroThemePlasma"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/aeroshell.rs
msgid ""
"<b>AeroThemePlasma has been removed, but its replacement for a part of "
"Plasma is still installed.</b>"
msgstr ""
"<b>AeroThemePlasma se ha desinstalado, pero su sustituto de una parte de "
"Plasma sigue instalado.</b>"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/aeroshell.rs
msgid ""
"Right now everything works, but the next Plasma update can break the whole "
"desktop: the panel and the lock screen may stop starting.<br><br>Rexon will "
"remove the leftover and put the standard Plasma part back. You'll be asked "
"for the password once; afterwards you'll need to log out and log back in."
msgstr ""
"Ahora todo funciona, pero la próxima actualización de Plasma puede romper "
"todo el escritorio: dejarán de iniciarse el panel y la pantalla de bloqueo."
"<br><br>Rexon quitará el resto y restaurará la parte estándar de Plasma. La "
"contraseña se pedirá una sola vez; después tendrás que cerrar la sesión y "
"volver a iniciarla."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/aeroshell.rs
msgid "Restore Standard Plasma"
msgstr "Restaurar Plasma estándar"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/aeroshell.rs
msgid "Restoring Standard Plasma"
msgstr "Restauración de Plasma estándar"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/aeroshell.rs
msgid "🧹 Removing the leftover and restoring standard Plasma…"
msgstr "🧹 Quitando el resto y restaurando Plasma estándar…"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/aeroshell.rs
msgid "✅ Standard Plasma restored"
msgstr "✅ Plasma estándar restaurada"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/aeroshell.rs
msgid ""
"The leftover has been removed and the standard Plasma part is back."
"<br><br><b>Log out and log back in</b> to finish."
msgstr ""
"Resto quitado; la parte estándar de Plasma se ha restaurado."
"<br><br><b>Cierra la sesión y vuelve a iniciarla</b> para terminar."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/aeroshell.rs
msgid "Nothing to rebuild"
msgstr "No hay nada que recompilar"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/aeroshell.rs
msgid ""
"No AUR package builder found (paru or yay) — the appearance can't be rebuilt "
"without it"
msgstr ""
"No se ha encontrado un asistente de compilación de AUR (paru o yay); sin él "
"no se puede recompilar la apariencia"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/aeroshell.rs
msgid "Couldn't put together the rebuild command"
msgstr "No se ha podido preparar la orden de recompilación"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/aeroshell.rs
msgid "✅ Appearance rebuilt"
msgstr "✅ Apariencia recompilada"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/aeroshell.rs
msgid ""
"The appearance was rebuilt for the current system version.\n"
"Log out and back in for everything to take effect."
msgstr ""
"La apariencia se ha recompilado para la versión actual del sistema.\n"
"Para que todo quede en su sitio, cierra la sesión y vuelve a iniciarla."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/aeroshell.rs
msgid "🔧 Rebuilding %n appearance package…"
msgid_plural "🔧 Rebuilding %n appearance packages…"
msgstr[0] "🔧 Recompilando %n paquete de apariencia…"
msgstr[1] "🔧 Recompilando %n paquetes de apariencia…"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/aeroshell.rs rust/rexon-gui/src/appearance_page.rs
msgid "Couldn't start %1: %2"
msgstr "No se ha podido iniciar %1: %2"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/aeroshell.rs
msgid "The build exited with code %1"
msgstr "La compilación ha terminado con el código %1"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/aeroshell.rs
msgid "⏳ The appearance is already being checked — wait until it finishes."
msgstr "⏳ Ya se está comprobando la apariencia: espera a que termine."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/aeroshell.rs
msgid "🔍 Checking the appearance…"
msgstr "🔍 Comprobando la apariencia…"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/aeroshell.rs
msgid "The appearance build took too long and was stopped. Try again later."
msgstr ""
"La compilación de la apariencia ha tardado demasiado y se ha detenido. "
"Vuelve a intentarlo más tarde."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/aeroshell.rs
msgid "Couldn't rebuild the appearance."
msgstr "No se ha podido recompilar la apariencia."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/aeroshell.rs
msgid "Last lines of the build:"
msgstr "Últimas líneas de la compilación:"

#. TRANSLATORS: %1 is the label of the “Check Now” button in Rexon settings.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/aeroshell.rs
msgid ""
"The administrator password wasn't confirmed — the rebuild was stopped.\n"
"Click “%1” in Rexon settings when you're ready to enter the password."
msgstr ""
"No se ha confirmado la contraseña de administrador: la recompilación se ha "
"detenido.\n"
"Pulsa «%1» en los ajustes de Rexon cuando estés listo para introducir la "
"contraseña."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/aeroshell.rs
msgid ""
"After the system update, AeroThemePlasma no longer fits the new Plasma: the "
"taskbar, the Start menu and effects may be missing. Rexon can rebuild it."
msgstr ""
"Tras actualizar el sistema, AeroThemePlasma ya no es compatible con la nueva "
"Plasma: pueden desaparecer la barra de tareas, el menú «Inicio» y los "
"efectos. Rexon puede recompilarla."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/aeroshell.rs
msgid ""
"AeroThemePlasma is gone, but its replacement for a part of Plasma is still "
"installed. The next Plasma update can break the whole desktop — Rexon can "
"put the standard part back."
msgstr ""
"AeroThemePlasma se ha desinstalado, pero su sustituto de una parte de Plasma "
"sigue instalado. La próxima actualización de Plasma puede romper todo el "
"escritorio; Rexon puede restaurar la parte estándar."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/aeroshell.rs rust/rexon-core/src/tray.rs
#: rust/rexon-gui/src/bin/main_window.rs
msgid "Open Rexon"
msgstr "Abrir Rexon"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/aeroshell.rs rust/rexon-core/src/session_guard.rs
msgid ""
"After the system update, AeroThemePlasma is still built for the previous "
"version of the system. It works for now, but it can fail at any moment. "
"Rexon can rebuild it."
msgstr ""
"Tras actualizar el sistema, AeroThemePlasma sigue compilada para la versión "
"anterior. De momento funciona, pero puede fallar en cualquier momento. Rexon "
"puede recompilarla."

