"Rexon: the repositories have %1 %2, and your Treeland build of it (without "
"deepin-kwin) is still %3."
msgstr ""
"Rexon: los repositorios ya tienen %1 %2, pero tu compilación para Treeland "
"(sin deepin-kwin) sigue en %3."

#. TRANSLATORS: arrows ← → point the way they should in your language: in right-to-left languages swap them.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/deepin_treeland.rs
msgid ""
"The Treeland session keeps working on the old build. To update it, open "
"Rexon → Desktops → Deepin → “Update the Treeland build”."
msgstr ""
"La sesión Treeland sigue usando la compilación anterior. Para actualizarla, "
"abre Rexon → «Escritorios» → Deepin → «Actualizar la compilación para "
"Treeland»."

#. TRANSLATORS: Screen effects note for any Deepin session not on Treeland (X11 and others).
#: rust/rexon-core/src/deepin_treeland.rs rust/rexon-core/src/screen_effects.rs
msgid "Rexon supports Deepin only on Treeland"
msgstr "Rexon solo admite Deepin sobre Treeland"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/deepin_treeland.rs
msgid ""
"The usual Deepin with the X11 session is installed here. Rexon doesn't "
"repair or reinstall it. To move to Deepin on Treeland, press “Switch to "
"Deepin on Treeland” on the Deepin card."
msgstr ""
"Aquí hay un Deepin normal con sesión X11. Rexon no lo repara ni lo "
"reinstala. Para pasar a Deepin sobre Treeland, pulsa «Pasar Deepin a "
"Treeland» en la ficha de Deepin."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/deepin_treeland.rs
msgid ""
"The Treeland build of deepin-session isn't installed, and the usual Deepin "
"set with deepin-kwin is never installed by Rexon. Install Deepin with the "
"“Install” button on its card."
msgstr ""
"La compilación de deepin-session para Treeland no está instalada, y Rexon "
"nunca instala el conjunto normal de Deepin con deepin-kwin. Instala Deepin "
"con el botón «Instalar» de su ficha."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/deepin_treeland.rs
msgid ""
"The list of Deepin packages couldn't be read from the repositories. Check "
"the internet connection and try again."
msgstr ""
"No se ha podido leer la lista de paquetes de Deepin en los repositorios. "
"Comprueba la conexión a internet y vuelve a intentarlo."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/deepin_treeland.rs
msgid "Deepin on Treeland (experimental)"
msgstr "Deepin en Treeland (experimental)"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/deepin_treeland.rs
msgid ""
"Deepin is installed on Treeland, its own Wayland session.\n"
"\n"
"• This is experimental: Treeland is still unstable, some Deepin settings and "
"applets may not work, and the session may crash.\n"
"• There is no X11 session of Deepin: its window manager (deepin-kwin) "
"conflicts with KWin of KDE Plasma and is never installed.\n"
"• deepin-session is built on your computer from the official Arch recipe — "
"the same sources, checksums and signatures, but without deepin-kwin. It is "
"installed as deepin-session-treeland.\n"
"• System updates don't touch this build. When Arch releases a new deepin-"
"session, the update log and the Deepin card in Rexon say so, and the build "
"is redone with one button.\n"
"• Deepin's own login screen (ddm) is installed because Treeland needs it, "
"but it isn't turned on: you keep your login screen. To log in, choose "
"“Treeland User” there.\n"
"\n"
"The password is asked once. If the build takes longer than a few minutes, it "
"may be asked once more before installing. Removing Deepin later removes all "
"of it."
msgstr ""
"Deepin se instalará en Treeland, su propia sesión Wayland.\n"
"\n"
"• Es experimental: Treeland todavía es inestable, algunos ajustes y applets "
"de Deepin pueden no funcionar y la sesión puede fallar.\n"
"• No habrá sesión de Deepin en X11: su gestor de ventanas (deepin-kwin) "
"entra en conflicto con KWin de KDE Plasma y nunca se instala.\n"
"• deepin-session se compila en tu equipo a partir de la receta oficial de "
"Arch: las mismas fuentes, sumas de comprobación y firmas, pero sin deepin-"
"kwin. Se instala con el nombre deepin-session-treeland.\n"
"• Las actualizaciones del sistema no tocan esta compilación. Cuando Arch "
"publique un nuevo deepin-session, te lo dirán el registro de actualización y "
"la tarjeta de Deepin en Rexon, y podrás recompilarlo con un solo botón.\n"
"• La pantalla de inicio de sesión propia de Deepin (ddm) se instala porque "
"Treeland no se instala sin ella, pero no se activa: conservas tu pantalla de "
"inicio de sesión. Para entrar, elige en ella «Treeland User».\n"
"\n"
"La contraseña se pide una vez; si la compilación tarda más de unos minutos, "
"puede pedirse otra vez antes de instalar. Si más adelante eliminas Deepin, "
"se quitará todo esto por completo."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/deepin_treeland.rs
msgid "🧪 Switch to Deepin on Treeland (experimental)"
msgstr "🧪 Pasar Deepin a Treeland (experimental)"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/deepin_treeland.rs
msgid ""
"This is the usual Deepin with the X11 session. Rexon supports Deepin only on "
"Treeland, its Wayland session: Rexon builds its own deepin-session without "
"deepin-kwin, puts it in place of the installed one and removes the X11 "
"session. Treeland is unstable. To log in, choose “Treeland User” on the "
"login screen."
msgstr ""
"Este es el Deepin habitual con sesión X11. Rexon solo es compatible con "
"Deepin en Treeland, su sesión Wayland: Rexon compilará su propia copia de "
"deepin-session sin deepin-kwin, la pondrá en lugar de la instalada y quitará "
"la sesión X11. Treeland es inestable. Para entrar, elige «Treeland User» en "
"la pantalla de inicio de sesión."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/deepin_treeland.rs
msgid "Switching to Deepin on Treeland (experimental)"
msgstr "Pasando Deepin a Treeland (experimental)"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/deepin_treeland.rs
msgid ""
"The usual Deepin will be moved to Treeland, its own Wayland session.\n"
"\n"
"• This is experimental: Treeland is still unstable, some Deepin settings and "
"applets may not work, and the session may crash.\n"
"• The X11 session of Deepin goes away: its window manager deepin-kwin is "
"removed, and the “Deepin” entry disappears from the login screen.\n"
"• deepin-session is built on your computer from the official Arch recipe — "
"the same sources, checksums and signatures, but without deepin-kwin — and "
"replaces the installed one as deepin-session-treeland. The rest of Deepin "
"and your settings stay.\n"
"• System updates don't touch this build. When Arch releases a new deepin-"
"session, the update log and the Deepin card in Rexon say so, and the build "
"is redone with one button.\n"
"• To log in, choose “Treeland User” on the login screen.\n"
"\n"
"The password is asked once. If the build takes longer than a few minutes, it "
"may be asked once more before installing."
msgstr ""
"El Deepin habitual pasará a Treeland, su propia sesión Wayland.\n"
"\n"
"• Es experimental: Treeland todavía es inestable, algunos ajustes y applets "
"de Deepin pueden no funcionar y la sesión puede fallar.\n"
"• La sesión de Deepin en X11 desaparecerá: se quita su gestor de ventanas "
"deepin-kwin y la entrada «Deepin» desaparece de la pantalla de inicio de "
"sesión.\n"
"• deepin-session se compila en tu equipo a partir de la receta oficial de "
"Arch (las mismas fuentes, sumas de comprobación y firmas, pero sin deepin-"
"kwin) y sustituye al instalado con el nombre deepin-session-treeland. El "
"resto de Deepin y tus ajustes se mantienen.\n"
"• Las actualizaciones del sistema no tocan esta compilación. Cuando Arch "
"publique un nuevo deepin-session, te lo dirán el registro de actualización y "
"la tarjeta de Deepin en Rexon, y podrás recompilarlo con un solo botón.\n"
"• Para entrar, elige «Treeland User» en la pantalla de inicio de sesión.\n"
"\n"
"La contraseña se pide una vez; si la compilación tarda más de unos minutos, "
"puede pedirse otra vez antes de instalar."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/deepin_treeland.rs
msgid "To try Deepin, log out and choose “Treeland User” on the login screen."
msgstr ""
"Para probar Deepin, cierra la sesión y elige «Treeland User» en la pantalla "
"de inicio de sesión."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/deepin_treeland.rs
msgid "🛠 Update the Treeland build"
msgstr "🛠 Actualizar la compilación para Treeland"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/deepin_treeland.rs
msgid ""
"The repositories have deepin-session %1, your Treeland build is %2. System "
"updates don't touch it; until you rebuild it, the Treeland session keeps "
"working on the old build."
msgstr ""
"En los repositorios está deepin-session %1; tu compilación para Treeland es "
"%2. Las actualizaciones del sistema no la tocan; hasta que la recompiles, la "
"sesión Treeland funciona con la anterior."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/deepin_treeland.rs
msgid "Updating the Treeland build of deepin-session"
msgstr "Actualizando la compilación de deepin-session para Treeland"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/deepin_treeland.rs
msgid ""
"deepin-session %1 will be built from the official Arch recipe without deepin-"
"kwin and will replace your build %2. The password is asked once. If the "
"build takes longer than a few minutes, it may be asked once more before "
"installing."
msgstr ""
"deepin-session %1 se compilará a partir de la receta oficial de Arch sin "
"deepin-kwin y sustituirá tu compilación %2. La contraseña se pide una vez; "
"si la compilación tarda más de unos minutos, puede pedirse otra vez antes de "
"instalar."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/deepin_treeland.rs
msgid ""
"deepin-session was built without deepin-kwin and installed as deepin-session-"
"treeland. Now the rest of Deepin is installed."
msgstr ""
"deepin-session se ha compilado sin deepin-kwin y se ha instalado como deepin-"
"session-treeland. Ahora se instala el resto de Deepin."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/deepin_treeland.rs
msgid ""
"The Treeland build of deepin-session was updated. The new build is used from "
"the next login to Treeland."
msgstr ""
"Se ha actualizado la compilación de deepin-session para Treeland. La nueva "
"compilación se usará a partir del próximo inicio de sesión en Treeland."

