#: rust/rexon-core/src/desktop_shell.rs
msgid "The wallpaper of %1 is back on, with the setting it had before."
msgstr ""
"El fondo de pantalla de %1 vuelve a estar activado, con el ajuste que tenía "
"antes de Rexon."

#. TRANSLATORS: button; turns off the desktop shell's own wallpaper so Rexon's wallpaper shows.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/desktop_shell.rs
msgid "Give Wallpaper to Rexon"
msgstr "Ceder el fondo a Rexon"

#. TRANSLATORS: button; turns the desktop shell's own wallpaper back on, as it was before Rexon.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/desktop_shell.rs
msgid "Return to Shell"
msgstr "Devolver a la shell"

#. TRANSLATORS: %1 is the shell name (Noctalia, DankMaterialShell). The quoted names are the two buttons next to this text.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/desktop_shell.rs
msgid ""
"The background is drawn by %1, and its own wallpaper covers Rexon's. “Give "
"Wallpaper to Rexon” turns the shell's wallpaper off; Rexon remembers the "
"previous setting, and “Return to Shell” brings it back."
msgstr ""
"El fondo lo dibuja %1, y su propio fondo de pantalla tapa el de Rexon. "
"«Ceder el fondo a Rexon» desactivará el fondo de pantalla de la shell; Rexon "
"recordará el ajuste anterior y «Devolver a la shell» lo restaurará."

#. TRANSLATORS: %1 is the shell name (Noctalia, DankMaterialShell). “Return to Shell” is the button next to this text.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/desktop_shell.rs
msgid ""
"The wallpaper of %1 is turned off at your request, and the background is "
"drawn by Rexon. “Return to Shell” turns it back on."
msgstr ""
"El fondo de pantalla de %1 está desactivado a petición tuya y el fondo lo "
"dibuja Rexon. «Devolver a la shell» lo volverá a activar."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/distro_compat.rs
msgid ""
"This distribution builds its own packages: some desktop environments may be "
"missing from its repositories."
msgstr ""
"Esta distribución compila sus propios paquetes: puede que algunos entornos "
"de escritorio no estén en sus repositorios."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/distro_compat.rs
msgid "Astra Linux SE runs a closed software environment (ZPS)."
msgstr "Astra Linux SE usa un entorno de software cerrado (ZPS)."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/distro_compat.rs
msgid ""
"Other desktop environments can only be installed on Astra Linux CE or with "
"the closed software environment turned off."
msgstr ""
"Solo se pueden instalar otros entornos de escritorio en Astra Linux CE o con "
"el entorno de software cerrado desactivado."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/distro_compat.rs
msgid ""
"The stock desktop is Fly. GNOME/KDE/XFCE/MATE are not available in the "
"standard repositories."
msgstr ""
"El escritorio de serie es Fly. GNOME/KDE/XFCE/MATE no están disponibles en "
"los repositorios estándar."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/distro_compat.rs
msgid "OSnova is a closed distribution certified by FSTEC."
msgstr "OSnova es una distribución cerrada certificada por FSTEC."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/distro_compat.rs
msgid "Its repositories are not public."
msgstr "Sus repositorios no son públicos."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/distro_compat.rs
msgid ""
"Rexon can manage packages, but the sources of desktop environments are "
"limited."
msgstr ""
"Rexon podrá gestionar paquetes, pero las fuentes de entornos de escritorio "
"son limitadas."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/distro_compat.rs
msgid "ALT Linux uses APT-RPM: apt-get with RPM packages."
msgstr "ALT Linux usa APT-RPM: apt-get con paquetes RPM."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/distro_compat.rs
msgid "Desktop environment package names differ from Debian and Fedora."
msgstr ""
"Los nombres de los paquetes de entornos de escritorio son distintos de los "
"de Debian y Fedora."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/distro_compat.rs
msgid "ROSA Linux uses its own task-* metapackages."
msgstr "ROSA Linux usa sus propios metapaquetes task-*."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/distro_compat.rs
msgid "The standard Fedora comps groups (@kde-desktop) may not work."
msgstr ""
"Puede que los grupos comps estándar de Fedora (@kde-desktop) no funcionen."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/distro_compat.rs
msgid "Rexon will try Fedora-compatible commands, but the results may differ."
msgstr ""
"Rexon probará comandos compatibles con Fedora, pero los resultados pueden "
"variar."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/distro_compat.rs
msgid ""
"RED OS is certified by FSTEC. Adding third-party repositories may void the "
"certification."
msgstr ""
"RED OS está certificado por FSTEC. Añadir repositorios de terceros puede "
"invalidar la certificación."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/distro_compat.rs
msgid ""
"NixOS uses a declarative model: Rexon doesn't install desktop environments "
"with nix-env commands, it gives you a snippet for /etc/nixos/"
"configuration.nix instead."
msgstr ""
"NixOS usa un modelo declarativo: Rexon no instala entornos de escritorio con "
"comandos nix-env, sino que te da un fragmento listo para /etc/nixos/"
"configuration.nix."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/distro_compat.rs
msgid "After adding the snippet, run: sudo nixos-rebuild switch"
msgstr "Después de añadir el fragmento, ejecuta: sudo nixos-rebuild switch"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/distro_compat.rs
msgid ""
"Astra Linux Special Edition detected. The closed software environment may "
"block package installation."
msgstr ""
"Se ha detectado Astra Linux Special Edition. El entorno de software cerrado "
"puede bloquear la instalación de paquetes."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/distro_compat.rs
msgid ""
"The closed software environment (ZPS) is ON. Installing unsigned packages is "
"blocked."
msgstr ""
"El entorno de software cerrado (ZPS) está ACTIVADO. La instalación de "
"paquetes sin firmar está bloqueada."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/distro_compat.rs
msgid ""
"APT-RPM is in use. Desktop environment packages are adapted for ALT Linux."
msgstr ""
"Se usa APT-RPM. Los paquetes de entornos de escritorio están adaptados a ALT "
"Linux."

#. TRANSLATORS: compatibility badge; %1 is the distribution name.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/distro_compat.rs
msgid "%1 (limited repositories)"
msgstr "%1 (repositorios limitados)"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/distro_compat.rs
msgid "Astra Linux SE security blocks the installation"
msgstr "La seguridad de Astra Linux SE bloquea la instalación"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/distro_compat.rs
msgid "This desktop is not in the Astra Linux repositories"
msgstr "Este escritorio no está en los repositorios de Astra Linux"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/distro_compat.rs
msgid "OSnova repositories are not public"
msgstr "Los repositorios de OSnova no son públicos"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/distro_compat.rs
msgid "ALT Linux: this desktop is not supported yet"
msgstr "ALT Linux: este escritorio aún no es compatible"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/distro_compat.rs
msgid "COSMIC is not packaged for this distribution yet"
msgstr "COSMIC aún no está empaquetado para esta distribución"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/distro_compat.rs
msgid "ROSA Linux: installation is possible, but not guaranteed"
msgstr "ROSA Linux: la instalación es posible, pero sin garantías"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/distro_compat.rs
msgid ""
"Astra Linux Special Edition runs a closed software environment: it only "
"starts software signed by the vendor. Desktop environment packages carry no "
"such signature, so the installation cannot succeed — it would fail somewhere "
"in the middle."
msgstr ""
"Astra Linux Special Edition tiene activado un entorno de software cerrado: "
"el sistema solo ejecuta programas con la firma digital del fabricante. Los "
"paquetes de entornos de escritorio no tienen esa firma, así que la "
"instalación no saldrá bien: fallará en algún punto a mitad del proceso."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/distro_compat.rs
msgid ""
"The stock Astra Linux package sources only carry its own Fly desktop. There "
"are no “%1” packages there, so there is nothing to download."
msgstr ""
"Las fuentes de paquetes de serie de Astra Linux solo incluyen su propio "
"escritorio Fly. Ahí no hay paquetes de «%1», así que no hay nada que "
"descargar."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/distro_compat.rs
msgid ""
"OSnova is a certified distribution with closed package sources. There is no "
"public place to download desktop environments from, so Rexon has nothing to "
"fetch."
msgstr ""
"OSnova es una distribución certificada con fuentes de paquetes cerradas. No "
"tiene ningún sitio público desde el que descargar entornos de escritorio, "
"así que Rexon no podrá descargar nada."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/distro_compat.rs
msgid ""
"ALT Linux builds its own packages under its own names. The mapping for “%1” "
"is not described yet, so Rexon does not know what to install."
msgstr ""
"ALT Linux compila sus propios paquetes con sus propios nombres. La "
"correspondencia de nombres para «%1» aún no está descrita, así que Rexon no "
"sabe qué instalar exactamente."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/distro_compat.rs
msgid ""
"COSMIC is a young desktop and is not packaged everywhere yet. This "
"distribution's package sources do not carry it."
msgstr ""
"COSMIC es un escritorio joven y todavía no está empaquetado en todas partes. "
"Las fuentes de paquetes de esta distribución no lo incluyen."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/distro_compat.rs
msgid ""
"ROSA installs desktops through its own task-* package sets, and there is "
"none for “%1”. Rexon will try the regular Fedora groups, but ROSA's package "
"sources may not have them."
msgstr ""
"En ROSA los escritorios se instalan con sus propios conjuntos de paquetes "
"task-*, y para «%1» no hay ninguno. Rexon probará los grupos habituales de "
"Fedora, pero puede que no estén en las fuentes de ROSA."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/distro_compat.rs
msgid ""
"What you can do: turn the closed software environment off (administrator "
"rights and a reboot are required) — or install the desktop on Astra Linux "
"CE, which has no such restriction."
msgstr ""
"Qué puedes hacer: desactivar el entorno de software cerrado (hacen falta "
"permisos de administrador y reiniciar) o instalar el escritorio en Astra "
"Linux CE, que no tiene esa restricción."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/distro_compat.rs
msgid ""
"What you can do: add the Debian package sources — Astra is based on Debian, "
"and the required packages will show up afterwards."
msgstr ""
"Qué puedes hacer: añadir las fuentes de paquetes de Debian (Astra se basa en "
"ella) y después aparecerán los paquetes necesarios."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/distro_compat.rs
msgid ""
"What you can do: request the package source from your system vendor (it "
"usually comes with the licence) and add it — Rexon will see the desktops "
"afterwards."
msgstr ""
"Qué puedes hacer: pedir la fuente de paquetes al proveedor del sistema "
"(suele entregarse con la licencia) y añadirla; después Rexon verá los "
"escritorios."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/distro_compat.rs
msgid "What you can do: pick one of the desktops verified on ALT Linux — %1."
msgstr ""
"Qué puedes hacer: elegir uno de los escritorios comprobados en ALT Linux: %1."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/distro_compat.rs
msgid ""
"What you can do: pick another desktop. COSMIC is packaged for Arch, Fedora, "
"openSUSE, Gentoo (through cosmic-overlay), Void and Alpine."
msgstr ""
"Qué puedes hacer: elegir otro escritorio. COSMIC está empaquetado para Arch, "
"Fedora, openSUSE, Gentoo (mediante cosmic-overlay), Void y Alpine."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/distro_compat.rs
msgid ""
"You may continue: if the packages are missing, the installation simply stops "
"and nothing breaks. Installed without a warning: %1."
msgstr ""
"Puedes continuar: si no se encuentran los paquetes, la instalación "
"simplemente se detendrá y el sistema no sufrirá daños. Se instalan sin "
"aviso: %1."

#. TRANSLATORS: SteamOS runs on Steam Deck and Steam Machine. "Startup movie" is the short video Rexon plays right after you log in.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/distro_compat.rs
msgid ""
"Themes, live wallpapers and the startup movie work on SteamOS and survive "
"system updates."
msgstr ""
"La apariencia, los fondos de pantalla animados y el vídeo de inicio "
"funcionan en SteamOS y sobreviven a las actualizaciones del sistema."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/distro_compat.rs
msgid ""
"Xfce, LXQt and Hyprland can be installed on SteamOS: Rexon builds them as "
"system extensions and rebuilds them by itself after every system update."
msgstr ""
"En SteamOS se pueden instalar Xfce, LXQt y Hyprland: Rexon los compila como "
"extensiones del sistema y los recompila por sí mismo después de cada "
"actualización del sistema."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/distro_compat.rs
msgid "SteamOS: this desktop environment can't be installed yet"
msgstr "SteamOS: este entorno de escritorio aún no se puede instalar"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/distro_compat.rs
msgid ""
"On SteamOS, Rexon doesn't change the packages of the system itself: the next "
"system update would undo it, so desktops are installed as system extensions "
"instead."
msgstr ""
"En SteamOS, Rexon no cambia los paquetes del propio sistema: la siguiente "
"actualización lo desharía, así que los escritorios se instalan como "
"extensiones del sistema."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/distro_compat.rs
msgid ""
"On SteamOS the login screen can't be changed: switching to Game Mode depends "
"on it."
msgstr ""
"En SteamOS no se puede cambiar la pantalla de inicio de sesión: de ella "
"depende el paso al modo de juego."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/distro_compat.rs
msgid ""
"On SteamOS the boot splash can't be changed: every system update puts the "
"original one back."
msgstr ""
"En SteamOS no se puede cambiar la pantalla de arranque: cada actualización "
"del sistema vuelve a poner la original."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/distro_compat.rs
msgid ""
"On SteamOS this can't be installed: it has to be written to the system "
"partition, which SteamOS keeps read-only."
msgstr ""
"En SteamOS esto no se puede instalar: hay que escribir en la partición del "
"sistema, y SteamOS la mantiene de solo lectura."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/distro_looks.rs
msgid "the Plasma description of the look is not in the %1 format"
msgstr "la descripción del aspecto para Plasma no está en el formato %1"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/distro_looks.rs
msgid "the description of the look for other desktops is not in the %1 format"
msgstr ""
"la descripción del aspecto para otros escritorios no está en el formato %1"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/distro_looks.rs
msgid "not chosen"
msgstr "sin elegir"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/distro_looks.rs
msgid "global theme"
msgstr "tema global"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/distro_looks.rs
msgid "colours"
msgstr "colores"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/distro_looks.rs
msgid "window frames"
msgstr "decoración de ventanas"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/distro_looks.rs
msgid "desktop shell theme"
msgstr "tema de la shell"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/distro_looks.rs
msgid "Qt application style"
msgstr "estilo de aplicaciones Qt"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/distro_looks.rs
msgid "GTK theme"
msgstr "tema GTK"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/distro_looks.rs
msgid "icons"
msgstr "iconos"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/distro_looks.rs
msgid "cursors"
msgstr "cursores"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/distro_looks.rs
msgid "fonts"
msgstr "tipos de letra"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/distro_looks.rs
msgid "wallpaper"
msgstr "fondo de pantalla"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/distro_looks.rs
msgid "panel layout"
msgstr "disposición de los paneles"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/distro_looks.rs
msgid "desktop behaviour"
msgstr "comportamiento del escritorio"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/distro_looks.rs
msgid "game mode"
msgstr "modo de juego"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/distro_looks.rs
msgid ""
"a global theme is a Plasma package, and this desktop has nothing like it"
msgstr ""
"un tema global es un paquete de Plasma, y este escritorio no tiene nada "
"parecido"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/distro_looks.rs
msgid ""
"GNOME has no panels to lay out: its top bar and dash belong to GNOME Shell"
msgstr ""
"GNOME no tiene paneles que se puedan disponer: la barra superior y el dock "
"forman parte del propio GNOME Shell"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/distro_looks.rs
msgid "Rexon can't lay out Xfce panels yet, so your panels stay as they are"
msgstr ""
"Rexon aún no sabe disponer los paneles de Xfce, así que tus paneles se "
"quedan como están"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/distro_looks.rs
msgid "%1 draws window borders itself, and there are no themes for them"
msgstr ""
"%1 dibuja él mismo los bordes de las ventanas y no hay temas para ellos"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/distro_looks.rs
msgid ""
"%1 has no panel of its own: a bar such as Waybar is chosen separately, in "
"the Shells block of its card in Desktops"
msgstr ""
"%1 no tiene panel propio: una barra como Waybar se elige aparte, en el "
"bloque «Shells» de su tarjeta en la pestaña «Escritorios»"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/distro_looks.rs
msgid ""
"%1 has no shell theme of its own. If you use Noctalia or DankMaterialShell, "
"press “%2” in Color Schemes after applying: they take the colours of this "
"look"
msgstr ""
"%1 no tiene tema de shell propio. Si usas Noctalia o DankMaterialShell, "
"después de aplicar pulsa «%2» en la sección «Esquemas de color»: tomarán los "
"colores de este aspecto"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/distro_looks.rs rust/rexon-core/src/themes.rs
msgid ""
"Deepin programs are drawn by its own Chameleon style, and Rexon does not "
"replace it"
msgstr ""
"los programas de Deepin se dibujan con su propio estilo Chameleon, y Rexon "
"no lo sustituye"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/distro_looks.rs
msgid "KWin window effects"
msgstr "efectos de ventanas de KWin"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/distro_looks.rs
msgid "the Plasma splash screen after login"
msgstr "la pantalla de bienvenida de Plasma tras iniciar sesión"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/distro_looks.rs
msgid "the Plasma lock screen picture"
msgstr "la imagen de la pantalla de bloqueo de Plasma"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/distro_looks.rs
msgid "KRunner in the middle of the screen"
msgstr "KRunner en el centro de la pantalla"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/distro_looks.rs
msgid "these settings exist only in Plasma"
msgstr "estos ajustes solo existen en Plasma"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/distro_looks.rs
msgid "it changes only things Plasma has: %1"
msgstr "solo cambia lo que existe en Plasma: %1"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/distro_looks.rs
msgid "it changes only things Plasma has: %1 — %2 has none of them"
msgstr "solo cambia lo que existe en Plasma: %1; %2 no tiene nada de eso"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/distro_looks.rs
msgid ""
"in Plasma it is one package of the parts listed here; on this desktop Rexon "
"applies them one by one"
msgstr ""
"en Plasma es un único paquete con las partes que se enumeran aquí; en este "
"escritorio Rexon las aplica por separado"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/distro_looks.rs
msgid ""
"the %1 panel is drawn by the GTK theme, and the GTK theme of this look is "
"applied"
msgstr ""
"el panel de %1 lo dibuja el tema GTK, y el tema GTK de este aspecto sí se "
"aplica"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/distro_looks.rs
msgid "wobbly windows"
msgstr "ventanas gelatinosas"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/distro_looks.rs
msgid "magic lamp minimise"
msgstr "minimizar con «lámpara mágica»"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/distro_looks.rs
msgid "fading windows"
msgstr "aparición y desaparición suave de ventanas"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/distro_looks.rs
msgid "cover switch window switcher"
msgstr "selector de ventanas en «carrusel»"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/distro_looks.rs
msgid "desktop name pop-up when switching desktops"
msgstr "aviso con el nombre del escritorio al cambiar de escritorio"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/distro_looks.rs
msgid "maximised windows without title bars"
msgstr "ventanas maximizadas sin barra de título"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/distro_looks.rs
msgid "not carried over: %1 — Compiz has no such setting"
msgstr "no se traslada: %1; Compiz no tiene ese ajuste"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/distro_looks.rs
msgid "not carried over: %1 — %2 has no such settings, these are KWin effects"
msgstr "no se traslada: %1; %2 no tiene esos ajustes, son efectos de KWin"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/distro_looks.rs
msgid ""
"instead of the desktop name pop-up, Compiz briefly shows its map of desktops "
"when you switch"
msgstr ""
"en lugar del aviso con el nombre del escritorio, Compiz muestra brevemente "
"su mapa de escritorios al cambiar"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/distro_looks.rs
msgid ""
"the clock sits at the right edge: the MATE panel can't put applets in the "
"middle"
msgstr ""
"el reloj queda en el borde derecho: el panel de MATE no puede poner applets "
"en el centro"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/distro_looks.rs
msgid ""
"the dock does not move out of the way of windows: the MATE panel can only "
"hide automatically"
msgstr ""
"el dock no deja sitio a las ventanas: el panel de MATE solo puede ocultarse "
"automáticamente"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/distro_looks.rs
msgid ""
"the dock spans the whole width of the screen and keeps Cinnamon's own pinned "
"programs: Cinnamon panels can't be shorter than the screen"
msgstr ""
"el dock ocupa todo el ancho de la pantalla y muestra los programas anclados "
"del propio Cinnamon: los paneles de Cinnamon no pueden ser más cortos que la "
"pantalla"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/distro_looks.rs
msgid "Qt programs pick it up after you log in again"
msgstr "los programas Qt lo aplicarán cuando vuelvas a iniciar sesión"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/distro_looks.rs
msgid "the programs it needs are not in this system's repositories"
msgstr "los programas necesarios no están en los repositorios de este sistema"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/distro_looks.rs
msgid ""
"“%1” can't be applied on this desktop: its required part “%2” is missing. %3"
msgstr ""
"«%1» no se puede aplicar en este escritorio: falta la parte obligatoria "
"«%2». %3"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/distro_looks.rs
msgid ""
"it needs %1 from the AUR, and Rexon does not build AUR packages by itself"
msgstr "hace falta %1 de AUR, y Rexon no compila paquetes de AUR por sí mismo"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/distro_looks.rs
msgid "“%1” was not applied: %2 — %3."
msgstr "«%1» no se ha aplicado: %2; %3."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/distro_looks.rs
msgid "“%1” was not applied: %2"
msgstr "«%1» no se ha aplicado: %2"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/distro_looks.rs
msgid "the programs it needs were not installed (%1). %2"
msgstr "no se han podido instalar los programas necesarios (%1). %2"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/distro_looks.rs
msgid "Rexon removed what it had installed: %1."
msgstr "Rexon ha desinstalado lo que había instalado: %1."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/distro_looks.rs
msgid "Rexon could not remove what it had installed (%1): %2"
msgstr "Rexon no ha podido desinstalar lo que había instalado (%1): %2"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/distro_looks.rs
msgid "%1 was not built from the AUR (%2), so what it gives is left out."
msgstr ""
"%1 no se ha compilado desde AUR (%2), así que se ha omitido lo que aporta."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/distro_looks.rs
msgid "the look wants to write outside your home folder: %1"
msgstr "el aspecto quiere escribir fuera de tu carpeta personal: %1"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/distro_looks.rs
msgid "%1 did not apply"
msgstr "%1: no se ha aplicado"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/distro_looks.rs
msgid "The programs Rexon installed for it stay: %1."
msgstr "Los programas que Rexon instaló para él se mantienen: %1."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/distro_looks.rs
msgid "“%1” applied."
msgstr "«%1» aplicado."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/distro_looks.rs
msgid "Skipped: %1 — %2"
msgstr "Omitido: %1; %2"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/distro_looks.rs
msgid ""
