"Rexon will not appear in the application menu — you will have to start it "
"from the folder it is in."
msgstr ""
"Rexon no aparecerá en el menú de aplicaciones: tendrás que iniciarlo desde "
"la carpeta en la que está."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/installer.rs
msgid ""
"The menu will not have the emergency item for restoring the desktop "
"appearance."
msgstr ""
"El menú no tendrá la entrada de emergencia para restaurar la apariencia del "
"escritorio."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/installer.rs
msgid ""
"Live wallpapers will not work in GNOME and Cinnamon: the add-on they need is "
"set up only by the installation."
msgstr ""
"Los fondos de pantalla animados no funcionarán en GNOME ni en Cinnamon: el "
"complemento que necesitan solo se configura durante la instalación."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/installer.rs
