"The current panel will be replaced with the “%1” layout. Its applets, "
"launchers and panel settings will be reset to what this layout has. Rexon "
"saves the current panel first, so you can bring it back with “Restore "
"previous panel”."
msgstr ""
"El panel actual se sustituirá por el diseño «%1». Los applets, lanzadores y "
"ajustes del panel se restablecerán a lo que indica el diseño. Rexon guardará "
"antes el panel actual: podrás recuperarlo con el botón «Restaurar el panel "
"anterior»."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/mate_panel.rs
msgid "Restore the previous MATE panel?"
msgstr "¿Restaurar el panel anterior de MATE?"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/mate_panel.rs
msgid ""
"The panel will go back to how it was before Rexon first changed its layout. "
"Changes made to the panel since then will be lost."
msgstr ""
"El panel volverá a estar como antes del primer cambio de diseño de Rexon. "
"Los cambios que hayas hecho en el panel desde entonces se perderán."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/mate_panel.rs
msgid "⚠️ The MATE panel is not available in this session."
msgstr "⚠️ El panel de MATE no está disponible en esta sesión."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/mate_panel.rs
msgid "⚠️ Panel layout “%1” was not found."
msgstr "⚠️ No se ha encontrado el diseño de panel «%1»."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/mate_panel.rs
msgid "⚠️ Could not read panel layout “%1”."
msgstr "⚠️ No se ha podido leer el diseño de panel «%1»."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/mate_panel.rs
msgid "⚠️ Panel layout “%1” has no panels."
msgstr "⚠️ El diseño «%1» no tiene ningún panel."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/mate_panel.rs
msgid "⚠️ Could not save the current panel, so nothing was changed: %1"
msgstr ""
"⚠️ No se ha podido guardar el panel actual, así que no se ha cambiado nada: %1"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/mate_panel.rs
msgid "⚠️ Could not write file %1"
msgstr "⚠️ No se ha podido escribir el archivo %1"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/mate_panel.rs
msgid "⚠️ Could not apply panel layout “%1”: %2"
msgstr "⚠️ No se ha podido aplicar el diseño de panel «%1»: %2"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/mate_panel.rs
msgid "✅ MATE panel: layout “%1” applied."
msgstr "✅ Panel de MATE: se ha aplicado el diseño «%1»."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/mate_panel.rs
msgid "⚠️ There is no saved panel to restore."
msgstr "⚠️ No hay ningún panel guardado que restaurar."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/mate_panel.rs
msgid "⚠️ Could not restore the previous panel: %1"
msgstr "⚠️ No se ha podido restaurar el panel anterior: %1"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/mate_panel.rs
msgid "✅ MATE panel restored to how it was before."
msgstr "✅ El panel de MATE ha vuelto a estar como antes."

#. TRANSLATORS: %1 is an HTTP status code (404, 503…).
#: rust/rexon-core/src/net.rs
msgid "The catalog server returned error %1"
msgstr "El servidor del catálogo ha respondido con el error %1"

#. TRANSLATORS: %1 is an HTTP status code, %2 the server's reason text (in English).
#: rust/rexon-core/src/net.rs
msgid "The catalog server returned error %1 (%2)"
msgstr "El servidor del catálogo ha respondido con el error %1 (%2)"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/net.rs
msgid "Couldn't reach the catalog server — check your internet connection"
msgstr ""
"No se ha podido conectar con el servidor del catálogo; comprueba tu conexión "
"a internet"

#. TRANSLATORS: %1 is a file name from the store, %2 is how many files the item has.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/ocs.rs
msgid "File: “%1” (the item has %2 files)"
msgstr "Archivo: «%1» (archivos del elemento en total: %2)"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/onboarding.rs
msgid ""
"Rexon changes how your desktop looks: themes, wallpapers, cursors, fonts. "
"I'll show you where everything is in a minute. You can skip this and turn it "
"on later in Settings."
msgstr ""
"Rexon cambia el aspecto del escritorio: temas, fondos de pantalla, cursores, "
"tipos de letra. En un minuto te enseño dónde está cada cosa. Puedes "
"saltártelo y activarlo más tarde en Ajustes."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/onboarding.rs
msgid ""
"The main tab. Here are the theme catalog, wallpapers, cursors and fonts. A "
"theme can be downloaded and applied in one click — no need to search "
"websites and unpack archives by hand."
msgstr ""
"La pestaña principal. Aquí están el catálogo de temas, los fondos de "
"pantalla, los cursores y los tipos de letra. Un tema se puede descargar y "
"aplicar con un solo clic: no hace falta buscar por webs ni descomprimir "
"archivos a mano."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/onboarding.rs
msgid "Theme catalog"
msgstr "Catálogo de temas"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/onboarding.rs
msgid ""
"Pick a section on the left; theme cards with previews are on the right. The "
"button on a card downloads the theme and applies it right away. Rexon keeps "
"your previous look, so you can always go back."
msgstr ""
"A la izquierda eliges la sección y a la derecha están las tarjetas de temas "
"con vista previa. El botón de la tarjeta descarga el tema y lo aplica al "
"momento. Rexon guarda el aspecto anterior, así que siempre puedes volver "
"atrás."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/onboarding.rs
msgid "Live wallpapers"
msgstr "Fondos de pantalla animados"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/onboarding.rs
msgid ""
"Video and animated wallpapers — the same as Wallpaper Engine on Windows. The "
"Workshop is here too: wallpapers can be downloaded and set right from it."
msgstr ""
"Fondos de pantalla de vídeo y animados: lo mismo que Wallpaper Engine en "
"Windows. Aquí también está el Workshop: puedes descargar y poner fondos "
"directamente desde él."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/onboarding.rs rust/rexon-core/src/tray.rs
msgid "Desktops"
msgstr "Escritorios"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/onboarding.rs
msgid ""
"Install and switch desktops — KDE, GNOME, Cinnamon and others. The current "
"desktop can't be removed: otherwise there would be nothing to log in to "
"after a reboot."
msgstr ""
"Instalación y cambio de escritorios: KDE, GNOME, Cinnamon y otros. El "
"escritorio actual no se puede eliminar: si no, tras reiniciar no habría "
"dónde iniciar sesión."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/onboarding.rs
msgid "App protection"
msgstr "Protección de aplicaciones"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/onboarding.rs
msgid ""
"Switching desktops tends to reset your default apps — browser, terminal, "
"viewer. Protection in Settings remembers your choice and brings it back. It "
"is on from the start."
msgstr ""
"Al cambiar de escritorio suelen restablecerse las aplicaciones "
"predeterminadas: navegador, terminal, visor. La protección de Ajustes "
"recuerda tu elección y la recupera. Viene activada desde el principio."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/onboarding.rs
msgid "Steam features"
msgstr "Funciones de Steam"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/onboarding.rs
msgid ""
"A startup movie when you log in — like on the Steam Deck — and Steam profile "
"backgrounds. You can pick a movie from the ones already in your library."
msgstr ""
"Un vídeo de bienvenida al iniciar sesión, como en Steam Deck, y fondos del "
"perfil de Steam. Puedes elegir el vídeo entre los que ya tienes en tu "
"biblioteca."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/onboarding.rs rust/rexon-core/src/qt_settings.rs
msgid "Done"
msgstr "Hecho"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/onboarding.rs
msgid ""
"That's all. You can take the tour again or turn it off in Settings. If "
"something goes wrong with the appearance, the Start menu has an emergency "
"recovery item."
msgstr ""
"Eso es todo. Puedes repetir el recorrido o desactivarlo en Ajustes. Si algo "
"se estropea con la apariencia, en el menú «Inicio» hay una opción de "
"recuperación de emergencia."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/onboarding.rs
msgid "Show a short tour?"
msgstr "¿Mostrar un recorrido breve?"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/onboarding.rs
msgid ""
"It takes about a minute: I'll show where to change themes, wallpapers and "
"appearance. You can turn this on or off later in Settings."
msgstr ""
"Dura un minuto aproximadamente: te enseño dónde cambiar los temas, los "
"fondos de pantalla y la apariencia. Más tarde puedes activarlo o "
"desactivarlo en Ajustes."

#. TRANSLATORS: button that agrees to show the first-launch tour.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/onboarding.rs
msgid "Show"
msgstr "Mostrar"

#. TRANSLATORS: button that declines the first-launch tour.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/onboarding.rs
msgid "No, thanks"
msgstr "No, gracias"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/onboarding.rs rust/rexon-gui/qml/MainWindow.qml
msgid "Next"
msgstr "Siguiente"

#. TRANSLATORS: %1 is the current step, %2 is the number of steps.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/onboarding.rs
msgid "Step %1 of %2"
msgstr "Paso %1 de %2"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/onboarding.rs
msgid "Tour on first launch"
msgstr "Recorrido en el primer inicio"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/onboarding.rs
msgid "Take the tour again"
msgstr "Repetir el recorrido"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/plasma_login.rs
msgid "Plasma Login Manager's helper couldn't make the change."
msgstr "El asistente de Plasma Login Manager no ha podido hacer el cambio."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/plasma_login.rs
msgid "The password wasn't entered, so the login screen stays as it was."
msgstr ""
"No se ha introducido la contraseña, así que la pantalla de inicio de sesión "
"se ha quedado como estaba."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/plasma_login.rs
msgid ""
"Plasma Login Manager's helper is busy with another change. Try again in a "
"moment."
msgstr ""
"El asistente de Plasma Login Manager está ocupado con otro cambio. Vuelve a "
"intentarlo dentro de un momento."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/plasma_login.rs
msgid ""
"This version of Plasma Login Manager doesn't support this change. Use its "
"own settings instead."
msgstr ""
"Esta versión de Plasma Login Manager no admite este cambio. Usa sus propios "
"ajustes."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/plasma_login.rs
msgid "Plasma Login Manager's helper refused the change."
msgstr "El asistente de Plasma Login Manager ha rechazado el cambio."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/plasma_login.rs
msgid ""
"Rexon couldn't reach Plasma Login Manager's helper. Nothing was changed."
msgstr ""
"Rexon no ha podido conectar con el asistente de Plasma Login Manager. No se "
"ha cambiado nada."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/plasma_login.rs
msgid ""
"Plasma Login Manager's helper sent an answer Rexon doesn't understand. Check "
"the login screen in its own settings."
msgstr ""
"El asistente de Plasma Login Manager ha enviado una respuesta que Rexon no "
"entiende. Comprueba la pantalla de inicio de sesión en sus propios ajustes."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/plasma_login.rs
msgid ""
"Plasma Login Manager's settings helper isn't installed, so Rexon can't "
"change the login screen. Reinstall the plasma-login-manager package."
msgstr ""
"El asistente de ajustes de Plasma Login Manager no está instalado, así que "
"Rexon no puede cambiar la pantalla de inicio de sesión. Reinstala el paquete "
"plasma-login-manager."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/plasma_login.rs
msgid ""
"Rexon couldn't find the login screen's system account “plasmalogin”. Check "
"that Plasma Login Manager is installed properly."
msgstr ""
"Rexon no ha encontrado la cuenta del sistema de la pantalla de inicio de "
"sesión «plasmalogin». Comprueba que Plasma Login Manager esté bien instalado."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/plasma_login.rs
msgid "Rexon couldn't read this picture. Nothing was changed."
msgstr "Rexon no ha podido leer esta imagen. No se ha cambiado nada."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/plasma_login.rs
msgid ""
"The login screen settings file is too large for Plasma Login Manager's "
"helper. Nothing was changed."
msgstr ""
"El archivo de ajustes de la pantalla de inicio de sesión es demasiado grande "
"para el asistente de Plasma Login Manager. No se ha cambiado nada."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/plasma_login.rs rust/rexon-core/src/system_plan.rs
msgid ""
"Done. The new background will show the next time the login screen appears."
msgstr ""
"Hecho. El nuevo fondo aparecerá la próxima vez que se abra la pantalla de "
"inicio de sesión."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/plasma_login.rs
msgid "Done. The login screen shows the standard background again."
msgstr ""
"Hecho. La pantalla de inicio de sesión vuelve a mostrar el fondo estándar."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/plasma_login.rs
msgid ""
"Rexon couldn't read the current login screen background, so it would be "
"lost. Nothing was changed."
msgstr ""
"Rexon no ha podido leer el fondo actual de la pantalla de inicio de sesión: "
"se perdería. No se ha cambiado nada."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/plasma_login.rs rust/rexon-core/src/system_plan.rs
msgid "Done. The login screen will show the clock."
msgstr "Hecho. La pantalla de inicio de sesión mostrará el reloj."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/plasma_login.rs rust/rexon-core/src/system_plan.rs
msgid "Done. The login screen won't show the clock."
msgstr "Hecho. La pantalla de inicio de sesión no mostrará el reloj."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/plasma_login.rs
msgid "Can't show the preview: Plasma Login Manager's greeter isn't installed."
msgstr ""
"No se puede mostrar la vista previa: el greeter de Plasma Login Manager no "
"está instalado."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/plasma_login.rs
msgid "Language and locale settings"
msgstr "Idioma y configuración regional"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/plasma_login.rs
msgid "Keyboard layouts"
msgstr "Distribuciones de teclado"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/plasma_login.rs
msgid "Screen arrangement, scale, and orientation settings"
msgstr "Disposición, escala y orientación de las pantallas"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/plasma_login.rs rust/rexon-core/src/system_plan.rs
msgid "NumLock preference"
msgstr "Comportamiento de NumLock"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/plasma_login.rs rust/rexon-core/src/system_plan.rs
msgid "Font"
msgstr "Tipo de letra"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/plasma_login.rs rust/rexon-core/src/system_plan.rs
msgid "Font rendering"
msgstr "Renderizado de tipos de letra"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/plasma_login.rs rust/rexon-core/src/system_plan.rs
msgid "Cursor theme and size"
msgstr "Tema y tamaño del cursor"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/plasma_login.rs rust/rexon-core/src/system_plan.rs
msgid "Plasma theme"
msgstr "Tema de Plasma"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/plasma_login.rs rust/rexon-core/src/system_plan.rs
msgid ""
"Done. The login screen will use these settings the next time it appears."
msgstr ""
"Hecho. La pantalla de inicio de sesión usará estos ajustes la próxima vez "
"que se abra."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/plasma_login.rs rust/rexon-core/src/system_plan.rs
msgid "Done. The login screen settings are back to default."
msgstr ""
"Hecho. Los ajustes de la pantalla de inicio de sesión se han restablecido a "
"los estándar."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/plasma_login.rs
msgid "Background: not a picture — set in the login screen's own settings"
msgstr ""
"Fondo: no es una imagen; se define en los ajustes propios de la pantalla de "
"inicio de sesión"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/plasma_login.rs
msgid "Background: the standard one"
msgstr "Fondo: el estándar"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/plasma_login.rs rust/rexon-core/src/system_plan.rs
msgid ""
"The login screen will reflect your customizations to the following Plasma "
"settings:"
msgstr "La pantalla de inicio de sesión adoptará tus ajustes de Plasma:"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/plasma_login.rs rust/rexon-core/src/system_plan.rs
msgid "The login screen will reflect these settings of your desktop:"
msgstr ""
"La pantalla de inicio de sesión adoptará estos ajustes de tu escritorio:"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/plasma_login.rs rust/rexon-core/src/system_plan.rs
msgid "Not set on this desktop, so the login screen keeps its own:"
msgstr ""
"No están definidos en este escritorio; la pantalla de inicio de sesión "
"conservará los suyos:"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/plasma_login.rs rust/rexon-core/src/system_plan.rs
msgid "Not taken from this desktop — the login screen keeps its own:"
msgstr ""
"No se trasladan desde este escritorio; la pantalla de inicio de sesión "
"conservará los suyos:"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/plasma_login.rs
msgid ""
"Themes and fonts show on the login screen only if they are installed for all "
"users."
msgstr ""
"Los temas y tipos de letra solo se ven en la pantalla de inicio de sesión si "
"están instalados para todos los usuarios."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/plasma_login.rs rust/rexon-core/src/system_plan.rs
msgid "Login screen background and look"
msgstr "Fondo y apariencia de la pantalla de inicio de sesión"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/plasma_login.rs rust/rexon-core/src/system_plan.rs
msgid "Change Background…"
msgstr "Cambiar el fondo…"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/plasma_login.rs
msgid "Use the Standard Background"
msgstr "Restaurar el fondo estándar"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/plasma_login.rs rust/rexon-core/src/system_plan.rs
msgid "Choose a Login Screen Background"
msgstr "Elige un fondo para la pantalla de inicio de sesión"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/plasma_login.rs rust/rexon-core/src/system_plan.rs
msgid "Apply Plasma Settings…"
msgstr "Aplicar los ajustes de Plasma…"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/plasma_login.rs rust/rexon-core/src/system_plan.rs
msgid "Apply Desktop Settings…"
msgstr "Aplicar los ajustes del escritorio…"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/plasma_login.rs rust/rexon-core/src/system_plan.rs
msgid "Reset to Default Settings…"
msgstr "Restablecer a los estándar…"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/plasma_login.rs rust/rexon-core/src/system_plan.rs
msgid "Apply Plasma Settings"
msgstr "Aplicar los ajustes de Plasma"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/plasma_login.rs rust/rexon-core/src/system_plan.rs
msgid "Apply Desktop Settings"
msgstr "Aplicar los ajustes del escritorio"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/plasma_login.rs
msgid ""
"The login screen will go back to its own cursor, font, colors, keyboard "
"layouts, language and screen settings. Its background and other settings "
"stay as they are."
msgstr ""
"La pantalla de inicio de sesión volverá a su propio cursor, tipo de letra, "
"colores, distribuciones de teclado, idioma y ajustes de pantallas. El fondo "
"y sus demás ajustes se quedarán como están."

#. TRANSLATORS: %1 is the effect name, %2 the KWin version it was
#. built for, %3 the KWin version installed now.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/plugin_journal.rs
msgid ""
"The “%1” effect is off: it was built for KWin %2, but KWin %3 is installed."
msgstr ""
"El efecto «%1» está desactivado: se compiló para KWin %2, pero está "
"instalado KWin %3."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/plugin_journal.rs
msgid "The “%1” effect is off: it was built for a different version of KWin."
msgstr "El efecto «%1» está desactivado: se compiló para otra versión de KWin."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/plugin_journal.rs
msgid "The “%1” effect is off: it doesn't load with the installed KWin."
msgstr "El efecto «%1» está desactivado: no se carga con el KWin instalado."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/plugin_journal.rs
msgid ""
"The “%1” widget is on the panel or desktop, but it isn't installed anymore."
msgstr ""
"El widget «%1» está en el panel o en el escritorio, pero ya no está "
"instalado."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/plugin_journal.rs
msgid ""
"The “%1” widget doesn't start: its parts don't match the installed Plasma."
msgstr ""
"El widget «%1» no se inicia: sus partes no encajan con la versión de Plasma "
"instalada."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/plugin_journal.rs
msgid ""
"The “%1” widget doesn't start: it was built for a different version of "
"Plasma."
msgstr "El widget «%1» no se inicia: se compiló para otra versión de Plasma."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/plugin_journal.rs
msgid ""
"The “%1” window decoration doesn't load: it was built for a different "
"version of the system."
msgstr ""
"La decoración de ventanas «%1» no se carga: se compiló para otra versión del "
"sistema."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/plugin_journal.rs
msgid "Remove it from the panel or install it again."
msgstr "Quítalo del panel o vuelve a instalarlo."

#. TRANSLATORS: %1 is the name of an AUR package.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/plugin_journal.rs
msgid "Rebuild the AUR package %1."
msgstr "Vuelve a compilar el paquete de AUR %1."

#. TRANSLATORS: %1 is the name of a package from the distribution.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/plugin_journal.rs
msgid ""
"Update the whole system: the package %1 doesn't match the rest of Plasma."
msgstr ""
"Actualiza todo el sistema: el paquete %1 no coincide con el resto de Plasma."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/plugin_journal.rs
msgid "Update it from the store or remove it."
msgstr "Actualízalo desde la tienda o elimínalo."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/plugin_journal.rs
msgid "Reinstall it or remove it."
msgstr "Reinstálalo o elimínalo."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/plugin_journal.rs
msgid "Some Desktop Add-ons Stopped Working"
msgstr "Algunos complementos del escritorio han dejado de funcionar"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/plugin_journal.rs
msgid ""
"KWin and Plasma reported in this session that these add-ons didn't load:"
msgstr ""
"KWin y Plasma han informado en esta sesión de que no han cargado estos "
"complementos:"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/plugin_journal.rs
msgid ""
"Rexon can rebuild the AUR packages now. This takes a few minutes; at the end "
"you'll need to log out and log back in."
msgstr ""
"Rexon puede volver a compilar los paquetes de AUR ahora mismo. Tardará unos "
"minutos; al final tendrás que cerrar la sesión y volver a iniciarla."

#. TRANSLATORS: An AUR package builder asked for administrator rights for something Rexon did not ask it to do.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/privilege/aur.rs
msgid ""
"Rexon refused this request from the AUR builder: it only installs what you "
"chose to build"
msgstr ""
"Rexon ha rechazado esta petición del compilador de AUR: solo instala lo que "
"has elegido compilar"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/privilege/aur.rs
msgid "Rexon closed the connection before the change finished"
msgstr "Rexon ha cerrado la conexión antes de que terminara el cambio"

#. TRANSLATORS: Rexon can't change the system: one of its own files is missing.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/privilege/client.rs
msgid ""
"Part of Rexon is missing, so it can't change the system. Reinstall Rexon."
msgstr ""
"Falta una parte de Rexon, así que no puede modificar el sistema. Reinstala "
"Rexon."

#. TRANSLATORS: Rexon refused to use its own system file because someone else could have changed it.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/privilege/client.rs
msgid ""
"Part of Rexon looks changed by someone else, so Rexon didn't use it. "
"Reinstall Rexon."
msgstr ""
"Parece que alguien ajeno ha modificado una parte de Rexon, y Rexon no la ha "
"usado. Reinstala Rexon."

#. TRANSLATORS: The password window was closed or the password was wrong.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/privilege/client.rs
msgid "Password not entered — no changes were made."
msgstr "No se ha introducido la contraseña: no se ha hecho ningún cambio."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/privilege/client.rs
msgid "Rexon couldn't start the change — nothing was changed. Try again."
msgstr ""
"Rexon no ha podido iniciar el cambio: el sistema no se ha tocado. Vuelve a "
"intentarlo."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/privilege/client.rs
msgid "Cancelled — nothing was changed."
msgstr "Cancelado: el sistema no se ha modificado."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/privilege/client.rs
msgid "Rexon lost track of the change halfway. Check whether it was applied."
msgstr ""
"Rexon ha perdido la conexión a mitad del cambio. Comprueba si se ha aplicado."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/privilege/client.rs
msgid ""
"Rexon lost permission to change the system before starting — nothing was "
"changed. Try again."
msgstr ""
"Rexon ha perdido el permiso antes de empezar el cambio: el sistema no se ha "
"tocado. Vuelve a intentarlo."

#. TRANSLATORS: The person pressed "Revoke now" (or closed the window) while a change was waiting.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/privilege/client.rs
msgid "Permission to change the system was turned off — nothing was changed."
msgstr ""
"Se ha retirado el permiso para modificar el sistema: no se ha hecho el "
"cambio."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/privilege/client.rs
msgid ""
"Rexon is already making another change. Wait for it to finish and try again."
msgstr ""
"Rexon ya está haciendo otro cambio. Espera a que termine y vuelve a "
"intentarlo."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/privilege/client.rs
msgid "Rexon couldn't ask for the password — nothing was changed."
msgstr "Rexon no ha podido pedir la contraseña: el sistema no se ha tocado."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/privilege/client.rs
msgid "Rexon couldn't make this change — nothing was changed."
msgstr "Rexon no ha podido hacer este cambio: el sistema no se ha tocado."

#. TRANSLATORS: Rexon was updated while its window was open; a system change needs a restart first.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/privilege/client.rs
msgid "Rexon was updated — restart it to continue."
msgstr "Rexon se ha actualizado: reinícialo para continuar."

#. TRANSLATORS: %1 is why permission to change the system ended (a whole sentence).
#: rust/rexon-core/src/privilege/client.rs
msgid "%1 Nothing was changed."
msgstr "%1 El sistema no se ha modificado."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/privilege/client.rs
msgid "Rexon refused: this package is needed by the system."
msgstr "Rexon se ha negado: el sistema necesita este paquete."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/privilege/client.rs
msgid ""
"Rexon refused: you are using this desktop right now. Sign in to another "
"desktop first."
msgstr ""
"Rexon se ha negado: estás usando este escritorio ahora mismo. Primero inicia "
"sesión en otro."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/privilege/client.rs
msgid ""
"Rexon refused: it couldn't tell which desktop you are using, so it didn't "
"remove anything."
msgstr ""
"Rexon se ha negado: no ha podido saber qué escritorio estás usando ahora, "
"así que no ha eliminado nada."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/privilege/client.rs
msgid "Rexon refused: this would remove other programs you have."
msgstr "Rexon se ha negado: esto eliminaría otros programas que tienes."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/privilege/client.rs
msgid "Rexon refused: this system doesn't allow installing programs this way."
msgstr ""
"Rexon se ha negado: este sistema no permite instalar programas de esta forma."

#. TRANSLATORS: "SteamOS" is a product name.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/privilege/client.rs
msgid "Rexon refused: this works only on SteamOS."
msgstr "Rexon se ha negado: esto solo funciona en SteamOS."

#. TRANSLATORS: Rexon was asked to remove a package that no longer gets updates, but the check showed otherwise.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/privilege/client.rs
msgid ""
"Rexon didn't remove the package: it is still available for updates or isn't "
"installed."
msgstr ""
"Rexon no ha eliminado el paquete: todavía recibe actualizaciones o no está "
"instalado."

#. TRANSLATORS: Rexon was asked to remove a package that no longer gets updates.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/privilege/client.rs
msgid ""
"Rexon didn't remove the package: other installed programs may still need it, "
"or the system is busy installing something. Nothing was changed."
msgstr ""
"Rexon no ha eliminado el paquete: puede que otros programas instalados lo "
"necesiten o que el sistema esté ocupado con una instalación. No se ha "
"cambiado nada."

#. TRANSLATORS: Rexon was asked to put the previous versions of packages back, but the check showed otherwise.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/privilege/client.rs
msgid ""
"Rexon didn't put the previous versions back: the packages on this computer "
"have changed since the check. Nothing was changed."
msgstr ""
"Rexon no ha restaurado las versiones anteriores: los paquetes de este equipo "
"han cambiado desde la comprobación. No se ha cambiado nada."

#. TRANSLATORS: Rexon was asked to put the previous versions of packages back.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/privilege/client.rs
msgid ""
"Rexon didn't put the previous versions back: they need other packages to be "
"installed or changed too, and Rexon doesn't do that by itself. Nothing was "
"changed."
msgstr ""
"Rexon no ha restaurado las versiones anteriores: habría que instalar o "
"sustituir también otros paquetes, y Rexon no lo hace por su cuenta. No se ha "
"cambiado nada."

#. TRANSLATORS: Rexon was asked to put the previous versions of packages back from files saved on this computer.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/privilege/client.rs
msgid ""
"Rexon didn't put the previous versions back: the signature of a saved "
"package doesn't match it, so the file may have been tampered with. Nothing "
"was changed."
msgstr ""
"Rexon no ha restaurado las versiones anteriores: la firma de un paquete "
"guardado no coincide con él; puede que el archivo se haya sustituido. No se "
"ha cambiado nada."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/privilege/client.rs
msgid "Rexon refused: it can't set up this login screen."
msgstr ""
"Rexon se ha negado: no sabe configurar esta pantalla de inicio de sesión."

#. TRANSLATORS: Rexon was asked to install a font for all users.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/privilege/client.rs
msgid ""
"Rexon refused: this file isn't a font it can install or remove for all users."
msgstr ""
"Rexon se ha negado: este archivo no es un tipo de letra que se pueda "
"instalar o eliminar para todos los usuarios."

#. TRANSLATORS: Rexon was asked to install a font for all users.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/privilege/client.rs
msgid ""
"A different font file with this name is already installed for all users. "
"Rexon didn't replace it — nothing was changed."
msgstr ""
"Ya hay instalado para todos los usuarios otro archivo de tipo de letra con "
"este nombre. Rexon no lo ha sustituido: no se ha cambiado nada."

#. TRANSLATORS: "fontconfig" is the name of the system's font library; keep it as is.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/privilege/client.rs
msgid ""
"Rexon couldn't check the font: fontconfig isn't installed on this system. "
"Nothing was changed."
msgstr ""
"Rexon no ha podido comprobar el tipo de letra: fontconfig no está instalado "
"en el sistema. No se ha cambiado nada."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/privilege/client.rs
msgid ""
"Rexon couldn't find the login screen's system account “sddm”. Check that "
"SDDM is installed properly. Nothing was changed."
msgstr ""
"Rexon no ha encontrado la cuenta del sistema de la pantalla de inicio de "
"sesión «sddm». Comprueba que SDDM esté bien instalado. No se ha cambiado "
"nada."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/privilege/client.rs
msgid ""
"This login screen theme isn't installed in the system folder or doesn't let "
"you change its background. Nothing was changed."
msgstr ""
"Este tema de la pantalla de inicio de sesión no está instalado en la carpeta "
"del sistema o no permite cambiar el fondo. No se ha cambiado nada."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/privilege/client.rs
msgid ""
"The login screen can't show this file: it isn't a PNG or JPEG picture, or a "
"WebP picture where Qt's WebP image module is installed. Nothing was changed."
msgstr ""
"La pantalla de inicio de sesión no puede mostrar este archivo: no es una "
"imagen PNG o JPEG (ni WebP con el módulo WebP de Qt instalado). No se ha "
"cambiado nada."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/privilege/client.rs
msgid ""
"Rexon refused: these desktop settings can't be moved to the login screen. "
"Nothing was changed."
msgstr ""
"Rexon se ha negado: estos ajustes del escritorio no se pueden trasladar a la "
"pantalla de inicio de sesión. No se ha cambiado nada."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/privilege/client.rs
msgid ""
"This login screen setting is fixed in a file Rexon doesn't change, so the "
"login screen wouldn't show it. Nothing was changed."
msgstr ""
"Este ajuste de la pantalla de inicio de sesión está fijado en un archivo que "
"Rexon no modifica, así que la pantalla de inicio de sesión no lo mostraría. "
"No se ha cambiado nada."

#. TRANSLATORS: "setpriv" and "util-linux" are program and package names; keep them as is.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/privilege/client.rs
msgid ""
"Rexon couldn't move the settings: the setpriv program (package util-linux) "
"is missing. Nothing was changed."
msgstr ""
"Rexon no ha podido trasladar los ajustes: falta el programa setpriv (paquete "
"util-linux). No se ha cambiado nada."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/privilege/client.rs
msgid "Rexon refused: this action isn't meant for your system."
msgstr "Rexon se ha negado: esta acción no es para tu sistema."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/privilege/client.rs
msgid "Rexon refused: it doesn't know this package, so nothing was installed."
msgstr ""
"Rexon se ha negado: no conoce este paquete, así que no se ha instalado nada."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/privilege/client.rs
msgid "Rexon refused: the package file is damaged or isn't the expected one."
msgstr ""
"Rexon se ha negado: el archivo del paquete está dañado o no es el paquete "
"esperado."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/privilege/client.rs
msgid ""
"Rexon refused: the file looks damaged or unsafe, so it wasn't installed."
msgstr ""
"Rexon se ha negado: el archivo parece dañado o poco seguro, así que no se ha "
"instalado."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/privilege/client.rs
msgid "Rexon refused to make this change — nothing was changed."
msgstr "Rexon se ha negado a hacer este cambio: el sistema no se ha tocado."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/privilege/revoke.rs
msgid ""
"Permission to change the system ended because the Rexon window was closed. "
"Rexon will ask for the password again."
msgstr ""
"El permiso para modificar el sistema ha terminado: se ha cerrado la ventana "
"de Rexon. Rexon volverá a pedir la contraseña."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/privilege/revoke.rs
msgid ""
"Permission to change the system ended because Rexon was minimized to the "
"tray. Rexon will ask for the password again."
msgstr ""
"El permiso para modificar el sistema ha terminado: Rexon se ha minimizado en "
"la bandeja. Rexon volverá a pedir la contraseña."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/privilege/revoke.rs
msgid ""
"Permission to change the system ended after 15 minutes without changes. "
"Rexon will ask for the password again."
msgstr ""
"El permiso para modificar el sistema ha terminado: han pasado 15 minutos sin "
"cambios. Rexon volverá a pedir la contraseña."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/privilege/revoke.rs
msgid ""
"Permission to change the system ended because the screen was locked. Rexon "
"will ask for the password again."
msgstr ""
"El permiso para modificar el sistema ha terminado: se ha bloqueado la "
"pantalla. Rexon volverá a pedir la contraseña."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/privilege/revoke.rs
msgid ""
"Permission to change the system ended because the computer went to sleep. "
"Rexon will ask for the password again."
msgstr ""
"El permiso para modificar el sistema ha terminado: el equipo ha entrado en "
"suspensión. Rexon volverá a pedir la contraseña."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/privilege/revoke.rs
msgid ""
"Permission to change the system ended because you switched to another user. "
"Rexon will ask for the password again."
msgstr ""
"El permiso para modificar el sistema ha terminado: has cambiado a otro "
"usuario. Rexon volverá a pedir la contraseña."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/privilege/revoke.rs
msgid ""
"Permission to change the system ended because Rexon couldn't check who is "
"signed in. Rexon will ask for the password again."
msgstr ""
"El permiso para modificar el sistema ha terminado: Rexon no ha podido "
"comprobar quién ha iniciado sesión. Rexon volverá a pedir la contraseña."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/privilege/revoke.rs
msgid ""
"You turned off Rexon's permission to change the system. Rexon will ask for "
"the password again."
msgstr ""
"Has retirado a Rexon el permiso para modificar el sistema. Rexon volverá a "
"pedir la contraseña."

