"%1 is licensed for non-commercial use only — the Workshop does not allow that"
msgstr ""
"%1 tiene una licencia solo para uso no comercial, y el Workshop no lo admite"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/rxn_manifest.rs
msgid "%1 forbids changes (ND) — Rexon does not share such content"
msgstr "%1 prohíbe las modificaciones (ND), y Rexon no publica algo así"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/rxn_manifest.rs
msgid "%1 is not free to share"
msgstr "%1 no se puede publicar libremente"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/rxn_manifest.rs
