msgstr "tema: %1"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/session_splash.rs
msgid "Couldn't turn on: %1"
msgstr "No se ha podido activar: %1"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/session_splash.rs
msgid "Couldn't save the startup movie settings: %1"
msgstr "No se han podido guardar los ajustes del vídeo de inicio: %1"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/session_splash.rs
msgid "Couldn't start mpv: %1"
msgstr "Error al iniciar mpv: %1"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/session_splash.rs
msgid "didn't start"
msgstr "no se ha iniciado"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/session_splash.rs
msgid "The Rexon startup movie is off."
msgstr "El vídeo de inicio de Rexon está desactivado."

#. TRANSLATORS: %1 is the name of an AeroThemePlasma module.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/session_watch.rs
msgid "“%1” made KWin crash"
msgstr "KWin se ha bloqueado por culpa de «%1»"

#. TRANSLATORS: %1 is the name of an AeroThemePlasma module.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/session_watch.rs
msgid "“%1” made the Plasma desktop crash"
msgstr "el escritorio Plasma se ha bloqueado por culpa de «%1»"

#. TRANSLATORS: %1 is a desktop shell (Noctalia…), %2 a desktop.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/shell_bundle.rs
msgid "%1 can't be added to %2."
msgstr "%1 no se puede añadir a %2."

#. TRANSLATORS: %1 is a desktop shell, %2 a compositor (sway).
#: rust/rexon-core/src/shell_bundle.rs
msgid ""
"%1 isn't packaged for %2: your distribution ships it only together with niri "
"or Hyprland."
msgstr ""
"%1 no está compilado para %2: tu distribución solo lo ofrece junto con niri "
"o Hyprland."

#. TRANSLATORS: %1 is a desktop shell (Noctalia, DankMaterialShell).
#: rust/rexon-core/src/shell_bundle.rs
msgid "%1 isn't in your distribution's official repositories."
msgstr "%1 no está en los repositorios oficiales de tu distribución."

#. TRANSLATORS: %1 is a desktop (Hyprland, niri, sway).
#: rust/rexon-core/src/shell_bundle.rs
msgid "Install %1 first"
msgstr "Primero instala %1"

#. TRANSLATORS: name of the KDE color scheme Rexon builds from the desktop shell's colors (shown in KDE's color settings).
#: rust/rexon-core/src/shell_palette.rs
msgid "Rexon — Shell Colors"
msgstr "Rexon: colores de la shell"

#. TRANSLATORS: %1 is the shell name, %2 a file path, %3 the technical reason. Nothing was changed.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/shell_palette.rs
msgid ""
"Rexon left the settings of %1 alone: %2 is not laid out the way Rexon "
"expects (%3). Nothing was changed."
msgstr ""
"Rexon no ha tocado los ajustes de %1: el archivo %2 no tiene la estructura "
"esperada (%3). No se ha cambiado nada."

#. TRANSLATORS: %1 is the shell name.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/shell_palette.rs
msgid "%1 already has this palette — nothing to change."
msgstr "%1 ya tiene esta paleta: no hay nada que cambiar."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/shell_palette.rs
msgctxt "theme mode"
msgid "dark"
msgstr "oscuro"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/shell_palette.rs
msgctxt "theme mode"
msgid "light"
msgstr "claro"

#. TRANSLATORS: %1 is the shell name, %2 is “dark” or “light”.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/shell_palette.rs
msgid ""
"Palette passed to %1. The shell's mode is set to %2, the same as the color "
"scheme, so the two no longer fight over the dark/light setting of "
"applications."
msgstr ""
"Paleta enviada a %1. El modo de la shell es %2, igual que el del esquema de "
"color, así que ya no se pelearán por el modo oscuro o claro de las "
"aplicaciones."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/shell_palette.rs
msgid ""
"There is no current color scheme to pass on: kdeglobals has no window "
"colors. Apply a color scheme in “Color Schemes” and try again."
msgstr ""
"No hay nada que enviar: kdeglobals no tiene colores de ventana. Aplica un "
"esquema de color en la sección «Esquemas de color» e inténtalo de nuevo."

#. TRANSLATORS: %1 is a file path.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/shell_palette.rs
msgid "The color file %1 could not be read."
msgstr "No se ha podido leer el archivo de colores %1."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/shell_palette.rs
msgid ""
"DankMaterialShell has not saved its colors to a file: it needs the matugen "
"package for that. Install matugen and change the theme in the shell once."
msgstr ""
"DankMaterialShell no ha guardado sus colores en un archivo: para ello "
"necesita el paquete matugen. Instala matugen y cambia el tema una vez en la "
"shell."

#. TRANSLATORS: %1 is the shell name; “Take Shell Colors” is the button name.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/shell_palette.rs
msgid ""
"Rexon asked %1 to share its colors, but the shell has not written them yet. "
"Press “Take Shell Colors” again in a few seconds."
msgstr ""
"Rexon ha pedido a %1 que comparta sus colores, pero la shell todavía no los "
"ha escrito. Vuelve a pulsar «Tomar colores de la shell» dentro de unos "
"segundos."

#. TRANSLATORS: %1 is the shell name; %2 is the name of the color scheme.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/shell_palette.rs
msgid "The colors of %1 are applied as the color scheme “%2”."
msgstr "Los colores de %1 se han aplicado como el esquema de color «%2»."

#. TRANSLATORS: %1 is the shell name.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/shell_palette.rs
msgid "The colors of %1 are already applied — nothing to change."
msgstr "Los colores de %1 ya están aplicados: no hay nada que cambiar."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/shell_palette.rs
msgid "Nothing to return: Rexon has not changed the shell's palette."
msgstr "No hay nada que restaurar: Rexon no ha cambiado la paleta de la shell."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/shell_palette.rs
msgid "The colors are back as they were before Rexon."
msgstr "Los colores se han restaurado tal como estaban antes de Rexon."

#. TRANSLATORS: %1 is the shell name.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/shell_palette.rs
msgid "The palette of %1 is back as it was before Rexon."
msgstr "La paleta de %1 se ha restaurado tal como estaba antes de Rexon."

#. TRANSLATORS: %1 is a list of files.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/shell_palette.rs
msgid ""
"Mostly returned. These files were changed by someone else since, and Rexon "
"left them as they are: %1"
msgstr ""
"Se ha restaurado casi todo. Alguien ha modificado estos archivos desde "
"entonces, y Rexon los ha dejado como están: %1"

#. TRANSLATORS: button; sends the current color scheme's palette (and dark/light mode) to the desktop shell.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/shell_palette.rs
msgid "Pass Palette to Shell"
msgstr "Enviar paleta a la shell"

#. TRANSLATORS: button; builds a color scheme from the desktop shell's colors and applies it.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/shell_palette.rs
msgid "Take Shell Colors"
msgstr "Tomar colores de la shell"

#. TRANSLATORS: button; undoes what Rexon changed in the shell's palette settings.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/shell_palette.rs
msgid "Return as It Was"
msgstr "Restaurar como estaba"

#. TRANSLATORS: %1 is the shell name (Noctalia).
#: rust/rexon-core/src/shell_palette.rs
msgid ""
"%1 paints its own panels and, at every start and theme change, sets the dark "
"or light mode of applications itself. So that the mode does not jump back "
"and forth, choose who leads the palette: Rexon passes its color scheme to "
"the shell together with the mode, or Rexon takes the shell's colors."
msgstr ""
"%1 colorea sus propios paneles y, cada vez que se inicia o cambia de tema, "
"pone por su cuenta el modo oscuro o claro a las aplicaciones. Para que el "
"modo no salte de uno a otro, elige quién lleva la paleta: Rexon envía a la "
"shell su esquema de color junto con el modo, o Rexon toma los colores de la "
"shell."

#. TRANSLATORS: %1 is the shell name (DankMaterialShell).
#: rust/rexon-core/src/shell_palette.rs
msgid ""
"%1 paints its own panels and, with its default “sync mode with portal” "
"setting, sets the dark or light mode of applications itself at every theme "
"change. So that the mode does not jump back and forth, choose who leads the "
"palette: Rexon passes its color scheme to the shell together with the mode, "
"or Rexon takes the shell's colors."
msgstr ""
"%1 colorea sus propios paneles y, con el ajuste predeterminado «Sync mode "
"with portal», pone por su cuenta el modo oscuro o claro a las aplicaciones "
"cada vez que cambia de tema. Para que el modo no salte de uno a otro, elige "
"quién lleva la paleta: Rexon envía a la shell su esquema de color junto con "
"el modo, o Rexon toma los colores de la shell."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/shell_palette.rs
msgid "Palette led by:"
msgstr "Paleta controlada por:"

#. TRANSLATORS: choice chip after “Palette led by:”.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/shell_palette.rs
msgctxt "palette lead"
msgid "Rexon"
msgstr "Rexon"

#. TRANSLATORS: choice chip after “Palette led by:” — the desktop shell (Noctalia, DankMaterialShell) leads.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/shell_palette.rs
msgctxt "palette lead"
msgid "Shell"
msgstr "Shell"

#. TRANSLATORS: %1 is the shell name.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/shell_palette.rs
msgid ""
"The palette is led by %1: the scheme is not passed to it, and the shell "
"keeps its own dark/light mode for applications."
msgstr ""
"La paleta la controla %1: no se le envía el esquema, y el modo oscuro o "
"claro de las aplicaciones queda en manos de la shell."

#. TRANSLATORS: %1 is the shell name; “Pass Palette to Shell” is the button name.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/shell_palette.rs
msgid ""
"%1 paints with its own palette. To give it this scheme, press “Pass Palette "
"to Shell” at the top of the page."
msgstr ""
"%1 usa su propia paleta. Para pasarle este esquema, pulsa «Enviar paleta a "
"la shell» en la parte superior de la página."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/shell_palette.rs
msgid ""
"No running desktop shell (Noctalia, DankMaterialShell) was found in this "
"session."
msgstr ""
"No se ha encontrado ninguna shell en ejecución en esta sesión (Noctalia, "
"DankMaterialShell)."

#. TRANSLATORS: %1 is the name of a color scheme.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/shell_palette.rs
msgid "Couldn't find the color scheme “%1”."
msgstr "No se ha encontrado el esquema de color «%1»."

#. TRANSLATORS: %1 is a file path, %2 the technical reason.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/shell_palette.rs
msgid "Couldn't apply the scheme: %1 could not be written (%2)."
msgstr "No se ha podido aplicar el esquema: no se ha podido escribir %1 (%2)."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/shell_palette.rs
msgid ""
"Color scheme applied to KDE and Qt apps. Apps that are already open pick it "
"up after a restart."
msgstr ""
"El esquema de color se ha aplicado a las aplicaciones de KDE y Qt. Las "
"aplicaciones que ya estén abiertas lo tomarán al reiniciarse."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/shell_palette.rs
msgid ""
"Color scheme applied to KDE apps (Dolphin, Kate, Okular…). Other Qt apps "
"won't get it: qt6ct isn't installed. Apps that are already open pick it up "
"after a restart."
msgstr ""
"El esquema de color se ha aplicado a las aplicaciones de KDE (Dolphin, Kate, "
"Okular…). El resto de aplicaciones Qt no lo recibirán: qt6ct no está "
"instalado. Las aplicaciones que ya estén abiertas lo tomarán al reiniciarse."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/shell_palette.rs
msgid "Other Qt apps switch to it after your next login."
msgstr ""
"El resto de aplicaciones Qt lo usarán a partir del próximo inicio de sesión."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/shell_palette.rs
msgid "GTK apps keep the colors of their GTK theme."
msgstr "Las aplicaciones GTK mantienen los colores de su tema GTK."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/shell_palette.rs
msgid "Nothing to return: Rexon has not changed the colors outside Plasma."
msgstr ""
"No hay nada que restaurar: fuera de Plasma, Rexon no ha cambiado los colores."

#. TRANSLATORS: Title of a desktop notification: the Rexon package was updated while Rexon kept running.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/single_instance.rs
msgid "Rexon was updated"
msgstr "Rexon se ha actualizado"

#. TRANSLATORS: Body of the "Rexon was updated" notification; the button below it says "Restart".
#: rust/rexon-core/src/single_instance.rs
msgid ""
"A new version of Rexon is installed, but the old one is still running. "
"Restart Rexon to start using the new version."
msgstr ""
"Se ha instalado una versión nueva de Rexon, pero sigue funcionando la "
"anterior. Reinicia Rexon para pasar a la nueva."

#. TRANSLATORS: Title of a desktop notification when Rexon failed to come back after a restart.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/single_instance.rs rust/rexon-gui/src/bin/main_window.rs
#: rust/rexon-gui/src/settings_actions.rs
msgid "Rexon didn't restart"
msgstr "Rexon no se ha reiniciado"

#. TRANSLATORS: Added to the "Rexon was updated" notification when the system can't show buttons.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/single_instance.rs
msgid ""
"To restart, choose “Quit” in the menu of the Rexon tray icon and open Rexon "
"again."
msgstr ""
"Para reiniciarlo, elige «Salir» en el menú del icono de Rexon en la bandeja "
"del sistema y vuelve a abrir Rexon."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/single_instance.rs
msgid "↑ Rexon is already running — brought its window to the front."
msgstr "↑ Rexon ya se está ejecutando: he traído su ventana al frente."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/single_instance.rs
msgid "⚠️  Rexon is already running — not adding a second tray icon."
msgstr ""
"⚠️  Rexon ya se está ejecutando: no creo un segundo icono en la bandeja."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/single_instance.rs
msgid "Lock: %1"
msgstr "Bloqueo: %1"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/single_instance.rs
msgid ""
"Couldn't bring up the window — look for the Rexon icon in the system tray."
msgstr ""
"No se ha podido traer la ventana al frente: busca el icono de Rexon en la "
"bandeja del sistema."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/single_instance.rs
msgid ""
"⚠️  Rexon is already open but doesn't respond to the request to show its "
"window. Open it from the icon in the system tray or restart Rexon."
msgstr ""
"⚠️  Rexon ya está abierto, pero no responde a la petición de mostrar la "
"ventana. Ábrelo desde el icono de la bandeja del sistema o reinicia Rexon."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/sound_preview.rs
msgid "Nothing to play"
msgstr "No hay nada que reproducir"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/sound_preview.rs
msgid "Couldn't start the player: %1"
msgstr "No se ha podido iniciar el reproductor: %1"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/sound_preview.rs
msgid "The archive is too large to preview"
msgstr "El archivo comprimido es demasiado grande para escucharlo"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/sound_preview.rs
msgid "This item has no download link"
msgstr "Este artículo no tiene enlace de descarga"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/sound_preview.rs
msgid "Couldn't download the theme to preview it"
msgstr "No se ha podido descargar el tema para escucharlo"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/splash_exec.rs rust/rexon-core/src/utils.rs
#: rust/rexon-core/src/wallpaper_exec.rs rust/rexon-gui/src/window_menu.rs
msgid "empty command"
msgstr "comando vacío"

#. TRANSLATORS: name shown for a Steam profile background that has none.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/steam_profile.rs
msgid "Profile Background"
msgstr "Fondo del perfil"

#. TRANSLATORS: name shown for the Steam profile background the user has
#. equipped on their profile, when Steam gives it no name.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/steam_profile_items.rs
msgid "Equipped Background"
msgstr "Fondo equipado"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/steam_screensaver.rs
#: rust/rexon-core/src/wallpaper_engine.rs
msgid "couldn't create %1: %2"
msgstr "no se ha creado %1: %2"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/steam_screensaver.rs
#: rust/rexon-core/src/wallpaper_engine.rs
msgid "couldn't write %1: %2"
msgstr "no se ha escrito %1: %2"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/steam_screensaver.rs
msgid "The folder %1 was not made by Rexon — it was left untouched."
msgstr "La carpeta %1 no la ha creado Rexon, así que no se ha tocado."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/steam_screensaver.rs
msgid "couldn't replace %1: %2"
msgstr "no se ha podido sustituir %1: %2"

#. TRANSLATORS: arrows ← → point the way they should in your language: in right-to-left languages swap them.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/steam_screensaver.rs
msgid ""
"In Steam Big Picture open Settings → Customization → Screensaver and choose "
"«rexon (User Created)». Steam keeps your choice; Rexon never changes it."
msgstr ""
"En Steam Big Picture, abre «Ajustes» → «Personalización» → «Salvapantallas» "
"y, en «Salvapantallas actual», elige «rexon (creado por el usuario)». Steam "
"recordará tu elección; Rexon nunca la cambia."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/steam_screensaver.rs
msgid "Slideshow"
msgstr "Presentación de diapositivas"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/steam_screensaver.rs
msgid "Artwork of your recently played games and your screenshots take turns."
msgstr ""
"Se alternan ilustraciones de los juegos recientes y tus capturas de pantalla."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/steam_screensaver.rs
msgid "Bouncing logo"
msgstr "Logotipo rebotando"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/steam_screensaver.rs
msgid "A logo floats across the screen and bounces off the edges."
msgstr "El logotipo flota por la pantalla y rebota en los bordes."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/steam_screensaver.rs
msgid "Rexon logo"
msgstr "Logotipo de Rexon"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/steam_screensaver.rs
msgid "Changes colour every time it hits an edge."
msgstr "Cambia de color cada vez que choca con un borde."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/steam_screensaver.rs
msgid "Logos of your games"
msgstr "Logotipos de tus juegos"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/steam_screensaver.rs
msgid "After each bounce off an edge the next recently played game is shown."
msgstr ""
"Tras cada choque con un borde, aparece el logotipo del siguiente juego "
"reciente."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/steam_screensaver.rs
msgid "Steam (Flatpak)"
msgstr "Steam (Flatpak)"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/steam_screensaver.rs
msgid "Steam was not found on this computer — install Steam and start it once."
msgstr ""
"No se ha encontrado Steam en este equipo: instala Steam y ejecútalo al menos "
"una vez."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/steam_screensaver.rs
msgid "✅ Installed. No pictures were found, so the bouncing logo is shown."
msgstr ""
"✅ Instalado. No se han encontrado imágenes, así que se muestra el logotipo "
"rebotando."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/steam_screensaver.rs
msgid "✅ Installed — %n picture."
msgid_plural "✅ Installed — %n pictures."
msgstr[0] "✅ Instalado: %n imagen."
msgstr[1] "✅ Instalado: %n imágenes."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/steam_screensaver.rs
msgid ""
"Steam already has another screensaver called «Rexon». Rexon did not make it "
"and leaves it alone."
msgstr ""
"Steam ya tiene otro salvapantallas llamado «Rexon». No lo ha creado Rexon, y "
"Rexon no lo toca."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/steam_screensaver.rs
msgid "⚪ Not installed yet."
msgstr "⚪ Todavía no está instalado."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/steam_screensaver.rs
msgid ""
"No game artwork or screenshots were found in Steam yet. Play a game or take "
"a screenshot (F12) — until then the screensaver shows the bouncing logo."
msgstr ""
"Steam todavía no tiene ilustraciones de juegos ni capturas de pantalla. "
"Juega a algo o haz una captura de pantalla (F12); mientras tanto, el "
"salvapantallas mostrará el logotipo rebotando."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/steam_screensaver.rs
msgid "%n game picture"
msgid_plural "%n game pictures"
msgstr[0] "%n imagen de juegos"
msgstr[1] "%n imágenes de juegos"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/steam_screensaver.rs
msgid "%n screenshot"
msgid_plural "%n screenshots"
msgstr[0] "%n captura de pantalla"
msgstr[1] "%n capturas de pantalla"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/steam_screensaver.rs
msgid "Found in your Steam: %1 and %2."
msgstr "Encontrado en tu Steam: %1 y %2."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/steam_screensaver.rs
msgid "Steam was not found on this computer."
msgstr "No se ha encontrado Steam en este equipo."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/steam_screensaver.rs
msgid "The screensaver is ready. Now choose it in Steam — see the steps below."
msgstr ""
"El salvapantallas está listo. Ahora elígelo en Steam; más abajo se explica "
"cómo."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/steam_screensaver.rs
msgid "The screensaver was not installed — there was nothing to remove."
msgstr "El salvapantallas no estaba instalado: no hay nada que eliminar."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/steam_screensaver.rs
msgid "The screensaver was removed from Steam."
msgstr "Se ha eliminado el salvapantallas de Steam."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/steam_screensaver.rs
msgid "Not in the list? Close Steam completely and start it again."
msgstr "¿No aparece en la lista? Cierra Steam por completo y vuelve a abrirlo."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/steam_showcase.rs
msgid "Artwork Showcase"
msgstr "Escaparate de ilustraciones"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/steam_showcase.rs
msgid "Featured Artwork Showcase"
msgstr "Ilustración destacada"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/steam_showcase.rs
msgid ""
"Two pictures side by side: a wide one (506 px) and a narrow one (100 px)."
msgstr ""
"Dos imágenes una junto a otra: una ancha (506 px) y una estrecha (100 px)."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/steam_showcase.rs
msgid "One wide picture (630 px)."
msgstr "Una sola imagen ancha (630 px)."

#. TRANSLATORS: part of a file name: the wide picture of a Steam
#. artwork showcase ("1-main.gif"). Lowercase, no spaces.
#. TRANSLATORS: word in the title of an uploaded Steam artwork: the
#. wide picture of the showcase.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/steam_showcase.rs
msgid "main"
msgstr "principal"

#. TRANSLATORS: part of a file name: the narrow right picture of a
#. Steam artwork showcase ("2-side.gif"). Lowercase, no spaces.
#. TRANSLATORS: word in the title of an uploaded Steam artwork: the
#. narrow right picture of the showcase.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/steam_showcase.rs
msgid "side"
msgstr "lateral"

#. TRANSLATORS: part of a file name: the picture of a Steam
#. featured artwork showcase ("1-featured.gif"). Lowercase, no spaces.
#. TRANSLATORS: word in the title of an uploaded Steam artwork: the
#. single picture of a featured artwork showcase.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/steam_showcase.rs
msgid "featured"
msgstr "destacada"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/steam_showcase.rs
msgid "Main (506 px)"
msgstr "Principal (506 px)"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/steam_showcase.rs
msgid "Side (100 px)"
msgstr "Lateral (100 px)"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/steam_showcase.rs
msgid "Featured (630 px)"
msgstr "Destacada (630 px)"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/steam_showcase.rs
msgid ""
"The picture is smaller than the showcase and will be stretched %1 times — it "
"may look blurry. A picture at least %2 px wide looks sharp."
msgstr ""
"La imagen es más pequeña que el escaparate y se estirará %1 veces; puede "
"verse borrosa. Una imagen se ve nítida a partir de %2 px de ancho."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/steam_showcase.rs
msgid "The file cannot be read."
msgstr "No se puede leer el archivo."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/steam_showcase.rs
msgid "This is not a PNG, JPG or GIF picture."
msgstr "No es una imagen PNG, JPG ni GIF."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/steam_showcase.rs
msgid "The GIF file is damaged."
msgstr "El archivo GIF está dañado."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/steam_showcase.rs
msgid "The picture is damaged."
msgstr "La imagen está dañada."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/steam_showcase.rs
msgid "Animated GIF: %1 frames, %2 s per loop."
msgstr "GIF animado: %1 fotogramas, una pasada dura %2 s."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/steam_showcase.rs
msgid ""
"The file is larger than 5 MB; Rexon will compress the parts to fit Steam's "
"limit."
msgstr ""
"El archivo ocupa más de 5 MB: Rexon comprimirá las partes para que quepan en "
"el límite de Steam."

#. TRANSLATORS: folder name for a set of showcase pictures when the
#. source file has no usable name.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/steam_showcase.rs
msgid "showcase"
msgstr "escaparate"

#. TRANSLATORS: file name of the instructions saved next to the showcase
#. pictures. Lowercase, words joined with "-".
#: rust/rexon-core/src/steam_showcase.rs
msgid "how-to-upload"
msgstr "como-subir"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/steam_showcase.rs
msgid "colours reduced to %1"
msgstr "se han conservado %1 colores"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/steam_showcase.rs
msgid "frames reduced from %1 to %2 (motion is less smooth)"
msgstr "ahora hay %2 fotogramas en lugar de %1 (movimiento menos fluido)"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/steam_showcase.rs
msgid ""
"To fit Steam's 5 MB limit the GIF was compressed: %1. Quality is lower than "
"the original."
msgstr ""
"Para caber en el límite de 5 MB de Steam, el GIF se ha comprimido: %1. La "
"calidad es inferior a la original."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/steam_showcase.rs
#: rust/rexon-gui/src/steam_showcase_actions.rs
msgid "The picture is too tall for a showcase."
msgstr "La imagen es demasiado alta para el escaparate."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/steam_showcase.rs
msgid "Cannot create the folder: %1"
msgstr "No se ha podido crear la carpeta: %1"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/steam_showcase.rs
msgid "Cannot save the file: %1"
msgstr "No se ha podido guardar el archivo: %1"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/steam_showcase.rs
msgid "Cancelled."
msgstr "Cancelado."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/steam_showcase.rs
msgid "Could not fit the picture into Steam's 5 MB limit."
msgstr "No se ha podido ajustar la imagen al límite de 5 MB de Steam."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/steam_showcase.rs
msgid "A part did not fit into 5 MB as PNG and was saved as JPG."
msgstr "Una parte no cabía en 5 MB en formato PNG y se ha guardado en JPG."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/steam_showcase.rs
msgid "JPG quality lowered to %1 to fit into 5 MB."
msgstr "Se ha reducido la calidad JPG a %1 para caber en 5 MB."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/steam_showcase.rs
msgid ""
"This GIF is too long or too large to process. Shorten it or make it smaller "
"and try again."
msgstr ""
"Este GIF es demasiado largo o demasiado grande para procesarlo. Acórtalo o "
"redúcelo e inténtalo de nuevo."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/steam_showcase.rs
msgid ""
"Steam does not synchronise GIFs in a showcase: the parts may drift apart. "
"Reloading the profile page starts them together again."
msgstr ""
"Steam no sincroniza los GIF del escaparate: las partes pueden desfasarse. Al "
"recargar la página del perfil vuelven a empezar a la vez."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/steam_showcase.rs
msgid ""
"Even after strong compression the GIF does not fit into Steam's 5 MB limit. "
"Shorten it or crop a smaller area and try again."
msgstr ""
"Incluso con una compresión fuerte, el GIF no cabe en el límite de 5 MB de "
"Steam. Acórtalo o elige una zona más pequeña e inténtalo de nuevo."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/steam_showcase.rs
msgid "Steam profile showcase: %1"
msgstr "Escaparate del perfil de Steam: %1"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/steam_showcase.rs
msgid "Files in this folder:"
msgstr "Archivos de esta carpeta:"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/steam_showcase.rs
msgid ""
"Showcases open at Steam level %1. Check your level on your profile page."
msgstr ""
"Los escaparates se desbloquean a partir del nivel %1 de Steam. Puedes ver tu "
"nivel en la página de tu perfil."

#. TRANSLATORS: arrows ← → point the way they should in your language: in right-to-left languages swap them.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/steam_showcase.rs
msgid "Open the artwork upload page in Steam: %1 (Profile → Artwork → Upload)."
msgstr ""
"Abre en Steam la página para subir ilustraciones: %1 (Perfil → Ilustraciones "
"→ Subir)."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/steam_showcase.rs
msgid ""
"Upload the files one by one, starting with number 1. Give each a clear "
"title, for example \"Showcase — main\" and \"Showcase — side\": in Steam's "
"picker the long pictures are hard to recognise by thumbnail."
msgstr ""
"Sube los archivos de uno en uno, empezando por el número 1. Ponle a cada uno "
"un nombre claro, por ejemplo «Escaparate: principal» y «Escaparate: "
"lateral»: en el selector de Steam, las imágenes alargadas son difíciles de "
"reconocer por la miniatura."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/steam_showcase.rs
msgid ""
"Tick \"I certify that I created this piece of art\" only if the picture is "
"really yours. For someone else's art Steam may remove the upload when the "
"author complains."
msgstr ""
"Marca la casilla «Certifico que he creado esta obra» solo si la imagen es "
"realmente tuya. Steam puede retirar una obra ajena si su autor la denuncia."

#. TRANSLATORS: arrows ← → point the way they should in your language: in right-to-left languages swap them.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/steam_showcase.rs
msgid ""
"Open Edit Profile → Featured Showcase, add \"Artwork Showcase\" and pick the "
"main file for the large slot and the side file for the right slot."
msgstr ""
"Abre «Editar perfil» → «Escaparate», añade un «Escaparate de ilustraciones» "
"y elige el archivo principal para el hueco grande y el lateral para el de la "
"derecha."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/steam_showcase.rs
msgid "Upload the file and give it a clear title."
msgstr "Sube el archivo y ponle un nombre claro."

#. TRANSLATORS: arrows ← → point the way they should in your language: in right-to-left languages swap them.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/steam_showcase.rs
msgid ""
"Open Edit Profile → Featured Showcase, add \"Featured Artwork Showcase\" and "
"pick the uploaded file."
msgstr ""
"Abre «Editar perfil» → «Escaparate», añade una «Ilustración destacada» y "
"elige el archivo subido."

#. TRANSLATORS: arrows ← → point the way they should in your language: in right-to-left languages swap them.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/steam_showcase.rs
msgid ""
"Note: by default Steam may show a tall picture shrunk or with black bars. "
"The same steps, with buttons that open the right Steam pages and a check of "
"the result, are in Rexon: Steam → Profile Showcases."
msgstr ""
"Ten en cuenta que, por defecto, Steam puede mostrar una imagen alta reducida "
"o con bandas negras. Los mismos pasos, con botones que abren las páginas de "
"Steam necesarias y con comprobación del resultado, están en Rexon: Steam → "
"«Escaparates del perfil»."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/steam_showcase.rs
msgid "%1 KB"
msgstr "%1 KB"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/steam_showcase.rs
msgid ""
"Press \"Open the upload page\": Steam opens the artwork upload page, and the "
"folder with the parts opens next to it."
msgstr ""
"Pulsa «Abrir página de subida»: Steam abrirá la página para subir "
"ilustraciones y, al lado, se abrirá la carpeta con las partes."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/steam_showcase.rs
msgid ""
"Upload the parts one by one, the main one first. For each: \"Choose file\" "
"on the page, paste the title, press \"Save and Continue\"."
msgstr ""
"Sube las partes de una en una, primero la principal. Para cada una: «Elegir "
"archivo» en la página, pega el nombre y pulsa «Guardar y continuar»."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/steam_showcase.rs
msgid ""
"\"Choose file\" on the page, paste the title, press \"Save and Continue\"."
msgstr ""
"«Elegir archivo» en la página, pega el nombre y pulsa «Guardar y continuar»."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/steam_showcase.rs
msgid ""
"Tick \"I certify that I created this piece of art\" only if the picture is "
"really yours."
msgstr ""
"Marca la casilla «Certifico que he creado esta obra» solo si la imagen es "
"realmente tuya."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/steam_showcase.rs
msgid ""
"Leave visibility \"Public\": a hidden picture cannot be put into a showcase."
msgstr ""
"Deja la visibilidad en «Pública»: una imagen oculta no se puede poner en el "
"escaparate."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/steam_showcase.rs
msgid ""
"After each upload tick the part here — Rexon remembers where you stopped."
msgstr ""
"Después de cada subida, marca aquí la parte: Rexon recuerda dónde te "
"quedaste."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/steam_showcase.rs
msgid ""
"Press \"Open the profile editor\": Steam opens Edit Profile on the showcases "
"section."
msgstr ""
"Pulsa «Abrir editor del perfil»: Steam abrirá «Editar perfil» en la sección "
"de escaparates."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/steam_showcase.rs
msgid "Choose \"%1\" in the showcase list."
msgstr "En la lista de escaparates, elige «%1»."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/steam_showcase.rs
msgid ""
"Click the large slot and pick the main part; click the first slot on the "
"right and pick the side part."
msgstr ""
"Haz clic en el hueco grande y elige la parte principal; haz clic en el "
"primer hueco de la derecha y elige la lateral."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/steam_showcase.rs
msgid "Press \"Save\" at the bottom of the page, then tick \"Done\" here."
msgstr "Pulsa «Guardar» al final de la página y luego marca aquí «Hecho»."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/steam_showcase.rs
msgid "Click the slot and pick the uploaded picture."
msgstr "Haz clic en el hueco y elige la imagen subida."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/steam_showcase.rs
msgid ""
"Press \"Check my profile\": Rexon reads your public profile page (without "
"signing in) and compares what Steam shows with your parts."
msgstr ""
"Pulsa «Comprobar mi perfil»: Rexon leerá la página pública de tu perfil (sin "
"iniciar sesión) y comparará lo que muestra Steam con tus partes."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/steam_showcase.rs
msgid "The profile must be public, otherwise there is nothing to read."
msgstr "El perfil debe ser público; si no, no hay nada que leer."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/steam_showcase.rs
msgid "Step 1. Upload the parts"
msgstr "Paso 1. Sube las partes"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/steam_showcase.rs
msgid "Step 2. Put them into the showcase"
msgstr "Paso 2. Ponlas en el escaparate"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/steam_showcase.rs
msgid "Step 3. Check"
msgstr "Paso 3. Compruébalo"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/steam_showcase.rs
msgid "The profile is private — there is nothing to read."
msgstr "El perfil es privado: no hay nada que leer."

#. TRANSLATORS: arrows ← → point the way they should in your language: in right-to-left languages swap them.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/steam_showcase.rs
msgid ""
"Open Edit Profile → Privacy Settings in Steam and set \"My profile\" to "
"\"Public\", then check again."
msgstr ""
"En Steam, abre «Editar perfil» → «Privacidad», pon «Mi perfil» en «Público» "
"y vuelve a comprobarlo."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/steam_showcase.rs
msgid "There is no \"%1\" on your profile page yet."
msgstr "La página del perfil todavía no tiene el escaparate «%1»."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/steam_showcase.rs
msgid "Do step 2: add the showcase in the profile editor and press \"Save\"."
msgstr ""
"Haz el paso 2: añade el escaparate en el editor del perfil y pulsa «Guardar»."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/steam_showcase.rs
msgid "The showcase is on the profile, but its slots are empty."
msgstr "El perfil tiene el escaparate, pero sus huecos están vacíos."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/steam_showcase.rs
msgid ""
"Do step 2: click each slot in the profile editor, pick the uploaded part and "
"press \"Save\"."
msgstr ""
"Haz el paso 2: en el editor del perfil, haz clic en cada hueco, elige la "
"parte subida y pulsa «Guardar»."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/steam_showcase.rs
msgid "%1: the slot is empty — pick the part in the profile editor."
msgstr "%1: el hueco está vacío; elige una parte en el editor del perfil."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/steam_showcase.rs
msgid "%1: Steam shows it as %2×%3 px, the part is %4×%5 px."
msgstr "%1: Steam la muestra a %2×%3 px, pero la parte mide %4×%5 px."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/steam_showcase.rs
msgid "✅ The parts are in the showcase and their sizes match."
msgstr "✅ Las partes están en el escaparate y los tamaños coinciden."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/steam_showcase.rs
msgid ""
"If the size differs, another picture may be in the slot, or Steam is "
"shrinking a tall picture. Check which picture is chosen in the profile "
"editor."
msgstr ""
"Si el tamaño no coincide, puede que el hueco tenga otra imagen o que Steam "
"reduzca la imagen alta. Comprueba qué imagen está elegida en el editor del "
"perfil."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/steam_showcase.rs
msgid "⚠️ The showcase does not match the parts yet."
msgstr "⚠️ El escaparate todavía no coincide con las partes."

#. TRANSLATORS: why Steam items can't be loaded; starts in lower case.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/steam_token.rs
msgid "sign in to Steam on this computer"
msgstr "inicia sesión en Steam en este equipo"

#. TRANSLATORS: why Steam items can't be loaded; starts in lower case.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/steam_token.rs
msgid "the Steam client didn't provide an access key"
msgstr "el cliente de Steam no ha proporcionado la clave de acceso"

#. TRANSLATORS: used as %1 in "the administrator password of %1" when the device is neither a recognised Steam Deck nor a Steam Machine.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/steamos_sysext.rs
msgid "this SteamOS device"
msgstr "este dispositivo con SteamOS"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/steamos_sysext.rs
msgid "Enter a password."
msgstr "Introduce la contraseña."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/steamos_sysext.rs
msgid "The two passwords are different — type the same password twice."
msgstr "Las contraseñas no coinciden: introduce la misma contraseña dos veces."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/steamos_sysext.rs
msgid "The password can't contain line breaks or other control characters."
msgstr ""
"La contraseña no puede contener saltos de línea ni otros caracteres de "
"control."

#. TRANSLATORS: %1 is a comma-separated list of desktop names, e.g. "Xfce, LXQt, Hyprland".
#: rust/rexon-core/src/steamos_sysext.rs
msgid ""
"On SteamOS Rexon builds a desktop as a system extension from Valve's own "
"package sources, and so far only %1 have been checked this way. This desktop "
"hasn't been checked yet: it may need parts that SteamOS keeps for itself "
"(login screen, drivers), so Rexon doesn't offer it."
msgstr ""
"En SteamOS, Rexon monta el escritorio como extensión del sistema a partir de "
"las fuentes de paquetes de la propia Valve, y de momento solo se han probado "
"así %1. Este escritorio todavía no se ha probado: puede necesitar partes que "
"SteamOS se reserva (pantalla de inicio de sesión, controladores), así que "
"Rexon no lo ofrece."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/steamos_sysext.rs
msgid "Install or remove a desktop environment on SteamOS"
msgstr "Instalación y desinstalación del entorno de escritorio en SteamOS"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/steamos_sysext.rs
msgid ""
"Rexon needs the administrator password to install or remove a desktop "
"environment on SteamOS."
msgstr ""
"Para instalar o desinstalar un entorno de escritorio en SteamOS, Rexon "
"necesita la contraseña de administrador."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/steamos_sysext.rs
msgid "This is not SteamOS."
msgstr "Esto no es SteamOS."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/steamos_sysext.rs
msgid "KDE Plasma is SteamOS's own desktop — it is always there."
msgstr ""
"KDE Plasma es el escritorio propio de SteamOS y siempre está disponible."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/steamos_sysext.rs
msgid ""
"The “deck” account is locked, so SteamOS can't confirm changes to the "
"system. Unlock it first (for example, set a new password in Konsole with "
"“passwd”)."
msgstr ""
"La cuenta «deck» está bloqueada y SteamOS no puede confirmar cambios en el "
"sistema. Primero desbloquéala (por ejemplo, establece una contraseña nueva "
"en Konsole con el comando «passwd»)."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/steamos_sysext.rs
msgid ""
"You are working in this desktop right now. Switch to another desktop first, "
"then remove this one."
msgstr ""
"Ahora mismo estás usando este escritorio. Primero cambia a otro y después "
"desinstala este."

#. TRANSLATORS: %1 is a desktop name (Xfce), %2 the SteamOS version (3.9.5).
#: rust/rexon-core/src/steamos_sysext.rs
msgid ""
"Rexon will build %1 for SteamOS %2 from Valve's package sources and add it "
"to the system as an extension — SteamOS itself stays untouched. You need the "
"internet and the administrator password.\n"
"\n"
"After every SteamOS update Rexon rebuilds %1 by itself as soon as the "
"internet is available; until then Desktop Mode starts KDE Plasma.\n"
"\n"
"When it's done, Desktop Mode will start %1. KDE Plasma stays available."
msgstr ""
"Rexon montará %1 para SteamOS %2 a partir de las fuentes de paquetes de "
"Valve y lo añadirá al sistema como extensión; SteamOS en sí no cambia. Hacen "
"falta conexión a internet y la contraseña de administrador.\n"
"\n"
"Después de cada actualización de SteamOS, Rexon volverá a montar %1 por sí "
"solo en cuanto haya conexión a internet; hasta entonces, el modo escritorio "
"iniciará KDE Plasma.\n"
"\n"
"Cuando todo esté listo, el modo escritorio iniciará %1. KDE Plasma seguirá "
"disponible."

#. TRANSLATORS: %1 is a desktop name.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/steamos_sysext.rs
msgid ""
"Rexon will remove %1 from SteamOS. If %1 is the desktop Desktop Mode starts, "
"KDE Plasma takes its place. Your files and settings in the home folder stay."
msgstr ""
"Rexon desinstalará %1 de SteamOS. Si el modo escritorio inicia %1, KDE "
"Plasma ocupará su lugar. Tus archivos y ajustes de la carpeta personal se "
"conservarán."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/steamos_sysext.rs
msgid "Set the administrator password"
msgstr "Establece la contraseña de administrador"

#. TRANSLATORS: %1 is "Steam Deck", "Steam Machine" or "this SteamOS device".
#: rust/rexon-core/src/steamos_sysext.rs
msgid ""
"Installing a desktop changes the system, so SteamOS asks for the "
"administrator password of %1 — the password of the user “deck”. It isn't set "
"yet. Choose it now and remember it: SteamOS will ask for it whenever the "
"system is changed (it is not your Steam account password)."
msgstr ""
"Instalar un escritorio modifica el sistema, así que SteamOS pide la "
"contraseña de administrador: en %1 es la contraseña del usuario «deck». "
"Todavía no está establecida. Créala ahora y recuérdala: SteamOS la pedirá "
"cada vez que se modifique el sistema (no es la contraseña de tu cuenta de "
"Steam)."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/steamos_sysext.rs
msgid "New password"
msgstr "Contraseña nueva"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/steamos_sysext.rs
msgid "Repeat the password"
msgstr "Repite la contraseña"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/steamos_sysext.rs
msgid "Set password"
msgstr "Establecer contraseña"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/steamos_sysext.rs
msgid ""
"The administrator password is set. SteamOS now asks for it once more to "
"confirm the change."
msgstr ""
"La contraseña de administrador está establecida. Ahora SteamOS la pedirá "
"otra vez para confirmar el cambio."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/steamos_sysext.rs
msgid "SteamOS didn't accept the password: %1"
msgstr "SteamOS no ha aceptado la contraseña: %1"

#. TRANSLATORS: %1 is a desktop name.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/steamos_sysext.rs
msgid ""
"%1 is installed. Log out (or switch to Desktop Mode from Game Mode) — %1 "
"starts. To go back to KDE Plasma, press “Switch” on the KDE Plasma card."
msgstr ""
"%1 está instalado. Cierra la sesión (o entra en el modo escritorio desde el "
"modo de juego) y se iniciará %1. Para volver a KDE Plasma, pulsa «Cambiar» "
"en la tarjeta de KDE Plasma."

#. TRANSLATORS: %1 is a desktop name.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/steamos_sysext.rs
msgid ""
"%1 is installed, but SteamOS didn't answer when Rexon tried to make it the "
"Desktop Mode desktop. Press “Switch” on the %1 card."
msgstr ""
"%1 está instalado, pero SteamOS no ha respondido cuando Rexon ha intentado "
"convertirlo en el escritorio del modo escritorio. Pulsa «Cambiar» en la "
"tarjeta de %1."

#. TRANSLATORS: %1 is a desktop name.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/steamos_sysext.rs
msgid ""
"No internet connection: Rexon downloads %1 from Valve's package sources. "
"Connect to the internet and press “Install” again. Nothing was changed."
msgstr ""
"No hay conexión a internet: Rexon descarga %1 de las fuentes de paquetes de "
"Valve. Conéctate a internet y vuelve a pulsar «Instalar». No se ha cambiado "
"nada."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/steamos_sysext.rs
msgid "The password wasn't entered or wasn't accepted. Nothing was changed."
msgstr ""
"No se ha introducido la contraseña o no se ha aceptado. No se ha cambiado "
"nada."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/steamos_sysext.rs
msgid ""
"%1 would have to replace parts of SteamOS itself, so Rexon stopped. Nothing "
"was changed."
msgstr ""
"%1 obligaría a sustituir partes de la propia SteamOS, así que Rexon se ha "
"detenido. No se ha cambiado nada."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/steamos_sysext.rs
msgid ""
"Valve's package sources for this SteamOS version don't have everything %1 "
"needs. Nothing was changed; try again after the next SteamOS update."
msgstr ""
"Las fuentes de paquetes de Valve para esta versión de SteamOS no tienen todo "
"lo que necesita %1. No se ha cambiado nada; inténtalo de nuevo tras la "
"próxima actualización de SteamOS."

#. TRANSLATORS: %1 is a desktop name.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/steamos_sysext.rs
msgid ""
"Rexon couldn't build %1 — the details are in the log above. KDE Plasma stays "
"the desktop."
msgstr ""
"Rexon no ha podido montar %1: consulta los detalles en el registro de "
"arriba. KDE Plasma sigue siendo el escritorio."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/steamos_sysext.rs
msgid "steamosctl didn't answer in time"
msgstr "steamosctl no ha respondido a tiempo"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/steamos_sysext.rs
msgid "SteamOS didn't switch Desktop Mode back to KDE Plasma"
msgstr "SteamOS no ha devuelto el modo escritorio a KDE Plasma"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/system.rs
msgctxt "CPU load"
msgid "Low"
msgstr "Baja"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/system.rs
msgctxt "CPU load"
msgid "Medium"
msgstr "Media"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/system.rs
msgctxt "CPU load"
msgid "High"
msgstr "Alta"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/system.rs
msgid "X11 + Wayland (experimental, AUR)"
msgstr "X11 + Wayland (experimental, AUR)"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/system.rs
msgid "🍃 The Cinnamon desktop with the full set of Linux Mint components"
msgstr ""
"🍃 Escritorio Cinnamon con el conjunto completo de componentes de Linux Mint"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/system.rs
msgid "A light and fast desktop that uses few resources"
msgstr "Escritorio ligero y rápido con bajo consumo de recursos"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/system.rs
msgid "A traditional desktop that carries on GNOME 2"
msgstr "Escritorio tradicional, continuación de GNOME 2"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/system.rs
msgid "A modern desktop with a minimalist design"
msgstr "Escritorio moderno con un diseño minimalista"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/system.rs
msgid "A powerful, customizable desktop with beautiful effects"
msgstr "Escritorio potente y personalizable con efectos vistosos"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/system.rs
msgid "An elegant desktop from Buddies of Budgie"
msgstr "Escritorio elegante de Buddies of Budgie"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/system.rs
msgid "The calm, macOS-like desktop of elementary OS"
msgstr "Escritorio sereno de elementary OS al estilo de macOS"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/system.rs
msgid ""
"The polished desktop of deepin with rounded, translucent windows, on its own "
"Wayland compositor Treeland (experimental)"
msgstr ""
"Vistoso escritorio deepin con ventanas redondeadas y semitransparentes, "
"sobre su propio compositor Wayland, Treeland (experimental)"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/system.rs
msgid "A new Wayland-native desktop from System76, written in Rust"
msgstr "Nuevo escritorio nativo de Wayland de System76, escrito en Rust"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/system.rs
msgid ""
"🪶 A lightweight Qt desktop, the successor to LXDE — the Qt counterpart of "
"XFCE"
msgstr "🪶 Escritorio Qt ligero, sucesor de LXDE: el equivalente Qt de XFCE"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/system.rs
msgid "none (Openbox WM; labwc optional)"
msgstr "ninguno (Openbox WM; labwc opcional)"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/system.rs
msgid ""
"🔥 A Wayland window manager with Compiz-style effects (desktop cube, wobbly "
"windows) and a simple wf-shell panel. It isn't a full desktop: it has no "
"programs or system settings of its own — only settings for Wayfire itself."
msgstr ""
"🔥 Gestor de ventanas Wayland con efectos al estilo de Compiz (cubo de "
"escritorios, ventanas «gelatinosas») y un panel sencillo, wf-shell. No es un "
"escritorio completo: no tiene aplicaciones propias ni ajustes generales del "
"sistema, solo los ajustes del propio Wayfire."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/system.rs
msgid "🪟 A tiling Wayland compositor with animations and high performance"
msgstr "🪟 Compositor Wayland en mosaico con animaciones y alto rendimiento"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/system.rs
msgid ""
"🧩 A tiling Wayland compositor — a drop-in replacement for i3 that reads its "
"config"
msgstr ""
"🧩 Compositor de Wayland en mosaico: sustituto directo de i3 que lee su "
"configuración"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/system.rs
msgid ""
"🎞️ A scrollable tiling Wayland compositor — windows sit on an endless "
"horizontal strip"
msgstr ""
"🎞️ Compositor de Wayland en mosaico con desplazamiento: las ventanas se "
"colocan en una tira horizontal infinita"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/system.rs
msgid ""
"🏞️ A dynamic tiling Wayland compositor: windows are grouped by tags instead "
"of workspaces"
msgstr ""
"🏞️ Compositor de Wayland en mosaico dinámico: las ventanas se agrupan por "
"etiquetas, no por escritorios"

#. TRANSLATORS: %1 is a desktop environment name (UKUI). Rexon recognizes the session but can't install this desktop or change its own settings yet.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/system.rs
msgid ""
"Rexon doesn't support the %1 desktop yet: it can't install it or change its "
"own settings. Wallpapers, themes, cursors and fonts work as on any other "
"desktop."
msgstr ""
"Rexon todavía no es compatible con el escritorio %1: no puede instalarlo ni "
"cambiar sus propios ajustes. Los fondos de pantalla, los temas, los cursores "
"y los tipos de letra funcionan como en cualquier otro escritorio."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/system.rs
msgid ""
"pkexec was not found: Rexon won't be able to do anything that needs "
"administrator rights — installing desktop environments, system themes or "
"login screens."
msgstr ""
"No se ha encontrado pkexec: Rexon no podrá realizar ninguna operación que "
"requiera permisos de administrador, como instalar entornos de escritorio, "
"temas del sistema o pantallas de inicio de sesión."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/system.rs
msgid ""
"pkexec was not found: Rexon won't be able to do anything that needs "
"administrator rights — installing desktop environments, system themes or "
"login screens. %1"
msgstr ""
"No se ha encontrado pkexec: Rexon no podrá realizar ninguna operación que "
"requiera permisos de administrador, como instalar entornos de escritorio, "
"temas del sistema o pantallas de inicio de sesión. %1"

#. TRANSLATORS: %1 is a desktop environment id.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/system_de_exec.rs
msgid "Rexon doesn't know the “%1” desktop."
msgstr "Rexon no conoce el escritorio «%1»."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/system_de_exec.rs
msgid "The operation was cancelled. The system wasn't changed."
msgstr "Se ha cancelado la operación. No se ha modificado el sistema."

#. TRANSLATORS: status line of the operation window after cancelling.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/system_de_exec.rs
msgid "Cancelled"
msgstr "Cancelado"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/system_de_exec.rs
msgid "A desktop operation is already running — wait until it finishes."
msgstr "Ya hay una operación con escritorios en curso: espera a que termine."

#. TRANSLATORS: %1 is the title of a question window.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/system_de_exec.rs
msgid "“%1” — answer in the window that opened."
msgstr "«%1»: responde en la ventana que se ha abierto."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/system_de_exec.rs
msgid "🔒 Remembering your default apps"
msgstr "🔒 Guardando tus aplicaciones predeterminadas"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/system_de_exec.rs
msgid "🛡️ Saving a copy of the KDE Plasma panel"
msgstr "🛡️ Guardando una copia del panel de KDE Plasma"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/system_de_exec.rs
msgid "🔧 Post-install setup"
msgstr "🔧 Configuración tras la instalación"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/system_de_exec.rs
msgid "⚙️ Login screen"
msgstr "⚙️ Pantalla de inicio de sesión"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/system_de_exec.rs
msgid "🔒 Restoring your default apps"
msgstr "🔒 Restaurando tus aplicaciones predeterminadas"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/system_de_exec.rs
msgid "🛡️ Setting up which apps open files in each desktop"
msgstr "🛡️ Configurando con qué abrir los archivos en cada escritorio"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/system_de_exec.rs
msgid "Couldn't remember the default apps: %1"
msgstr "No se han podido guardar las aplicaciones predeterminadas: %1"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/system_de_exec.rs
msgid "The KDE panel copy wasn't saved: %1"
msgstr "No se ha guardado la copia del panel de KDE: %1"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/system_de_exec.rs
msgid "📦 Installing: %n package"
msgid_plural "📦 Installing: %n packages"
msgstr[0] "📦 Instalando: %n paquete"
msgstr[1] "📦 Instalando: %n paquetes"

#. TRANSLATORS: %1 is the sentence about packages, %2 how many more come from the AUR.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/system_de_exec.rs
msgid "%1 + %2 from the AUR"
msgstr "%1 + %2 del AUR"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/system_de_exec.rs
msgid "🔍 Checking: %n package"
msgid_plural "🔍 Checking: %n packages"
msgstr[0] "🔍 Comprobando: %n paquete"
msgstr[1] "🔍 Comprobando: %n paquetes"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/system_de_exec.rs
msgid "✅ The main packages are all in place — nothing to install"
msgstr ""
"✅ Todos los paquetes principales están instalados: no hay nada que instalar"

#. TRANSLATORS: %1 is a desktop environment name.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/system_de_exec.rs
msgid "✅ %1 checked — everything is in place"
msgstr "✅ %1 comprobado: todo está en su sitio"

