"NixOS uses a declarative model.\n"
"Add this to /etc/nixos/configuration.nix:\n"
"\n"
"%1\n"
"\n"
"Then run:\n"
"  sudo nixos-rebuild switch"
msgstr ""
"NixOS usa un modelo declarativo.\n"
"Añade esto a /etc/nixos/configuration.nix:\n"
"\n"
"%1\n"
"\n"
"Después ejecuta:\n"
"  sudo nixos-rebuild switch"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/system_plan.rs
msgid ""
"Rexon can't set up the '%1' desktop on NixOS.\n"
"Set it up yourself in /etc/nixos/configuration.nix."
msgstr ""
"Rexon no puede configurar el escritorio '%1' en NixOS.\n"
"Configúralo manualmente en /etc/nixos/configuration.nix."

