msgstr "Instalación en SteamOS completada"

#. TRANSLATORS: %1 is the distribution name, %2 package names.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/system_plan.rs
msgid ""
"%1 is an immutable distribution.\n"
"The regular dnf doesn't work here. Use:\n"
"\n"
"  rpm-ostree install %2\n"
"  systemctl reboot\n"
"\n"
"Or install the desktop with Fedora Toolbox / Distrobox."
msgstr ""
"%1 es una distribución inmutable.\n"
"El dnf habitual no funciona aquí. Usa:\n"
"\n"
"  rpm-ostree install %2\n"
"  systemctl reboot\n"
"\n"
"O instala el escritorio con Fedora Toolbox / Distrobox."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/system_plan.rs
msgid ""
"Bazzite is an immutable (ostree) distribution.\n"
"To install packages:\n"
"\n"
"  rpm-ostree install %1\n"
"  systemctl reboot\n"
"\n"
"Or use Distrobox for an isolated environment."
msgstr ""
"Bazzite es una distribución inmutable (ostree).\n"
"Para instalar paquetes:\n"
"\n"
"  rpm-ostree install %1\n"
"  systemctl reboot\n"
"\n"
"O usa Distrobox para tener un entorno aislado."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/system_plan.rs
msgid ""
"%1 is an immutable distribution.\n"
"Installing packages with the regular package manager may not work.\n"
"Use Flatpak, Distrobox or your distribution's own tools."
msgstr ""
"%1 es una distribución inmutable.\n"
"Puede que no funcione instalar paquetes con el gestor de paquetes habitual.\n"
"Usa Flatpak, Distrobox o las herramientas propias de tu distribución."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/system_plan.rs
msgid ""
"You can't remove your current desktop (%1): after you log out there would be "
"nothing to log in to. Switch to another installed desktop first."
msgstr ""
"No puedes desinstalar tu escritorio actual (%1): al cerrar la sesión no "
"habría ningún escritorio en el que entrar. Cambia primero a otro escritorio "
"instalado."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/system_plan.rs
msgid "No packages for this distribution"
msgstr "No hay paquetes para esta distribución"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/system_plan.rs
msgid "Couldn't detect your current desktop"
msgstr "No se ha podido determinar tu escritorio actual"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/system_plan.rs
msgid "Already in use: %1"
msgstr "Ya en uso: %1"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/system_plan.rs
msgid "Rexon does not remove %1: the system needs it to work"
msgstr "Rexon no desinstala %1: el sistema lo necesita para funcionar"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/system_plan.rs
msgid "Invalid package name: %1. A package name is expected, not a file path."
msgstr ""
"Nombre de paquete no válido: %1. Se espera un nombre de paquete, no una ruta "
"de archivo."

#. TRANSLATORS: Name of the system action in the password dialog (polkit).
#: rust/rexon-core/src/system_plan.rs
msgid "Install or repair a desktop environment"
msgstr "Instalar o reparar un entorno de escritorio"

#. TRANSLATORS: Text of the system password dialog (polkit).
#: rust/rexon-core/src/system_plan.rs
msgid "Authentication is required to install a desktop environment"
msgstr "Se requiere autenticación para instalar un entorno de escritorio"

#. TRANSLATORS: Name of the system action in the password dialog (polkit).
#: rust/rexon-core/src/system_plan.rs
msgid "Install, remove or update packages"
msgstr "Instalar, desinstalar o actualizar paquetes"

#. TRANSLATORS: Text of the system password dialog (polkit).
#: rust/rexon-core/src/system_plan.rs
msgid "Authentication is required to manage packages"
msgstr "Se requiere autenticación para gestionar paquetes"

#. TRANSLATORS: Name of the system action in the password dialog (polkit): login screen background, greeter theme or MATE panel layout.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/system_plan.rs
msgid "Install a system login-screen or panel layout"
msgstr ""
"Instalar una pantalla de inicio de sesión o una disposición del panel del "
"sistema"

#. TRANSLATORS: Name of the system action in the password dialog (polkit): one password lets Rexon make system changes until its window is closed.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/system_plan.rs
msgid "Allow Rexon system changes while its window is open"
msgstr ""
"Permitir a Rexon hacer cambios en el sistema mientras su ventana esté abierta"

#. TRANSLATORS: Text of the system password dialog (polkit): one password for all system changes until the Rexon window is closed.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/system_plan.rs
msgid ""
"Authentication is required to let Rexon make system changes until its window "
"is closed"
msgstr ""
"Se requiere autenticación para que Rexon pueda hacer cambios en el sistema "
"mientras su ventana esté abierta"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/system_plan.rs
msgid "the Deepin window manager"
msgstr "el gestor de ventanas de Deepin"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/system_plan.rs
msgid ""
"⛔ You have %1 installed — the new River branch, which has no built-in "
"tiling. Rexon installs the classic River branch (river-classic) with its own "
"tiling, and for that %1 has to be replaced."
msgstr ""
"⛔ Tienes instalado %1, la nueva rama de River, que no incluye mosaico "
"integrado. Rexon instala la rama clásica de River (river-classic) con su "
"propio mosaico y, para ello, hay que sustituir %1."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/system_plan.rs
msgid ""
"Your ~/.config/river/init stays as it is. If it was written for %1, the "
"classic River will run it too; if River then starts without keys, rename "
"that file, and “Check / Repair” will put the Rexon starter one in its place."
msgstr ""
"Tu ~/.config/river/init se queda como está. Si se escribió para %1, el River "
"clásico también lo ejecutará; si después River se inicia sin atajos de "
"teclado, cambia el nombre de ese archivo y «Comprobar / Reparar» pondrá en "
"su lugar el inicial de Rexon."

#. TRANSLATORS: %1 is the installed program being replaced (e.g. “River 0.5”).
#: rust/rexon-core/src/system_plan.rs
msgid "🔁 Replace %1"
msgstr "🔁 Sustituir %1"

#. TRANSLATORS: %1 is the installed program (e.g. “River 0.5”), %2 the
#. package installed in its place.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/system_plan.rs
msgid ""
"Rexon will ask first. %1 is removed and %2 installed in the same pacman "
"transaction: if the installation doesn't go through, %1 stays."
msgstr ""
"Rexon te preguntará primero. %1 se desinstala y %2 se instala en la misma "
"transacción de pacman: si la instalación no sale bien, %1 se queda."

#. TRANSLATORS: %1 is the installed program being replaced (e.g. “River 0.5”).
#: rust/rexon-core/src/system_plan.rs
msgid "Replace %1"
msgstr "Sustituir %1"

#. TRANSLATORS: %1 is the installed program (e.g. “River 0.5”), %2 its
#. package, %3 the package installed in its place, %4 the desktop.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/system_plan.rs
msgid ""
"%1 (package %2) will be removed, and %3 will be installed in its place; then "
"%4 is set up as usual. It all happens in one pacman transaction: if it "
"doesn't go through, %1 stays installed.\n"
"\n"
"Replace it?"
msgstr ""
"%1 (paquete %2) se desinstalará y en su lugar se instalará %3; después %4 se "
"configura como siempre. Todo ocurre en una sola transacción de pacman: si no "
"sale bien, %1 seguirá instalado.\n"
"\n"
"¿Sustituirlo?"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/system_plan.rs
msgid "Rexon can replace a conflicting package only with pacman."
msgstr "Rexon solo puede sustituir un paquete en conflicto mediante pacman."

#. TRANSLATORS: %1 is the desktop being installed, %2 the installed
#. desktop, %3 a program both need (e.g. mutter), %4 the version %1
#. needs, %5 the package of that version, %6 the version %2 needs.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/system_plan.rs
msgid ""
"⛔ %1 can't be installed next to %2: %1 needs %3 %4 (%5), and %2 needs %3 "
"%6; the two can't be installed at once. To install %1, you'd have to remove "
"%2 — Rexon doesn't remove another desktop by itself."
msgstr ""
"⛔ %1 no se puede instalar junto a %2: %1 necesita %3 %4 (%5) y %2 necesita "
"%3 %6; no pueden estar instalados a la vez. Para instalar %1 tendrías que "
"desinstalar %2, y Rexon no desinstala otro escritorio por su cuenta."

#. TRANSLATORS: %1 is the desktop being installed, %2 the installed
#. desktop, %3 the package of %1 (role and name), %4 the package of %2.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/system_plan.rs
msgid ""
"⛔ %1 can't be installed next to %2: %3 conflicts with %4. To install %1, "
"you'd have to remove %2 — Rexon doesn't remove another desktop by itself."
msgstr ""
"⛔ %1 no se puede instalar junto a %2: %3 entra en conflicto con %4. Para "
"instalar %1 tendrías que desinstalar %2, y Rexon no desinstala otro "
"escritorio por su cuenta."

#. TRANSLATORS: %1 is the package being installed, %2 an installed
#. package, %3 the installed packages that need %2 (comma-separated).
#: rust/rexon-core/src/system_plan.rs
msgid ""
"⛔ Installation won't work: %1 conflicts with the installed package %2 "
"(needed by %3). pacman would have to remove %2 along with them, and Rexon "
"doesn't do that by itself."
msgstr ""
"⛔ La instalación no saldrá bien: %1 entra en conflicto con el paquete "
"instalado %2 (lo necesitan: %3). pacman tendría que desinstalar %2 junto con "
"ellos, y Rexon no lo hace por su cuenta."

#. TRANSLATORS: %1 is the package being installed, %2 an installed package.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/system_plan.rs
msgid ""
"⛔ Installation won't work: %1 conflicts with the installed package %2. "
"pacman would have to remove %2, and Rexon doesn't do that by itself."
msgstr ""
"⛔ La instalación no saldrá bien: %1 entra en conflicto con el paquete "
"instalado %2. pacman tendría que desinstalar %2, y Rexon no lo hace por su "
"cuenta."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/system_plan.rs
msgid ""
"⏳ Waiting for the package manager to become free (another transaction is "
"still running its hooks)…"
msgstr ""
"⏳ Esperando a que el gestor de paquetes quede libre (otra operación con "
"paquetes todavía no ha terminado sus pasos finales)…"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/system_plan.rs
msgid ""
"The rollback didn't start: no stock package was found to replace the fork."
msgstr ""
"No se ha iniciado la reversión: no se ha encontrado ningún paquete normal de "
"KDE que sustituya al fork."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/system_plan.rs
msgid "(the fork didn't name any package)"
msgstr "(el fork no ha indicado ningún nombre)"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/system_plan.rs
msgid "%1 — not in the repositories: %2"
msgstr "%1: no está en los repositorios: %2"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/system_plan.rs
msgid ""
"Usually this means KDE renamed the stock package, while the fork build still "
"uses the old name.\n"
"Nothing was removed — your system is untouched.\n"
"\n"
"What to do: refresh the package database (System Update) and try again. If "
"the name still can't be found, the fork needs a fresh rebuild — it will "
"bring the correct stock name."
msgstr ""
"Normalmente significa que KDE ha cambiado el nombre del paquete normal, "
"mientras que la compilación del fork sigue con el nombre antiguo.\n"
"No se ha eliminado nada: el sistema está intacto.\n"
"\n"
"Qué hacer: actualiza la base de datos de paquetes (Actualización del "
"sistema) y vuelve a intentarlo. Si el nombre sigue sin encontrarse, hay que "
"recompilar el fork con una compilación nueva, que traerá el nombre de "
"paquete correcto."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/system_plan.rs
msgid "pacman didn't finish the rollback."
msgstr "pacman no ha completado la reversión."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/system_plan.rs
msgid ""
"What pacman said:\n"
"%1"
msgstr ""
"Lo que ha respondido pacman:\n"
"%1"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/system_plan.rs
msgid ""
"Still to run (you can do it by hand in a terminal):\n"
"%1"
msgstr ""
"Falta por ejecutar (puedes hacerlo manualmente en una terminal):\n"
"%1"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/system_plan.rs
msgid ""
"No forks are left on the system — the rollback seems to have gone through "
"after all. Log out and log back in."
msgstr ""
"Ya no quedan forks en el sistema: parece que, al final, la reversión ha "
"salido bien. Cierra la sesión y vuelve a iniciarla."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/system_plan.rs
msgid "No Plasma forks found — nothing to roll back."
msgstr "No se han encontrado forks de Plasma: no hay nada que revertir."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/system_plan.rs
msgid "Couldn't build the rollback command."
msgstr "No se ha podido crear la orden de reversión."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/system_plan.rs
msgid "No Plasma forks found"
msgstr "No se han encontrado forks de Plasma"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/system_plan.rs
msgid "Nothing to do"
msgstr "No hay nada que hacer"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/system_plan.rs
msgid "Forks removed, stock packages restored."
msgstr "Forks eliminados; se han restaurado los paquetes normales de KDE."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/system_plan.rs
msgid "Couldn't determine the distribution's default Plymouth theme"
msgstr ""
"No se ha podido determinar el tema de Plymouth predeterminado de la "
"distribución"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/system_plan.rs
msgid ""
"Nothing to switch the boot splash with: neither plymouth-set-default-theme "
"nor update-alternatives was found"
msgstr ""
"No hay con qué cambiar la pantalla de arranque: no se ha encontrado ni "
"plymouth-set-default-theme ni update-alternatives"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/system_plan.rs
msgid "Couldn't reset Plymouth"
msgstr "Error al restablecer Plymouth"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/system_plan.rs
msgid "Plymouth is already on the default theme “%1”"
msgstr "Plymouth ya usa el tema predeterminado «%1»"

#. TRANSLATORS: %1 is a theme name; “%1.plymouth” is its file name.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/system_plan.rs
msgid "The “%1” theme has no %1.plymouth file"
msgstr "El tema «%1» no tiene el archivo %1.plymouth"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/system_plan.rs
msgid ""
"Plymouth reset to “%1” (initramfs rebuilt; takes effect after a restart)."
msgstr ""
"Plymouth restablecido a «%1» (initramfs regenerado; se aplicará tras "
"reiniciar)."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/system_plan.rs
msgid "The login screen will go back to the distribution default “%1”."
