msgstr "No se han encontrado monitores de Xfce"

#. TRANSLATORS: %1 is a program name; keep {stderr} as is:
#. the program replaces it with the error output.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/wallpaper_engine.rs
#, rust-format
msgid "Couldn't start %1: {stderr}"
msgstr "No se ha podido iniciar %1: {stderr}"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/wallpaper_engine.rs
msgid ""
"Wallpapers on %1 need a background program. Install swww (%2) — or swaybg/"
"hyprpaper/wbg."
msgstr ""
"Los fondos de pantalla en %1 necesitan un programa de fondo. Instala swww "
"(%2), o bien swaybg/hyprpaper/wbg."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/wallpaper_engine.rs
msgid ""
"On %1 there's nothing to show animated wallpapers with: both swww and "
"mpvpaper draw their own window through wlr-layer-shell, which the shell "
"doesn't have. Live wallpapers there are shown by the shell extension — "
"choose a video wallpaper (MP4/WebM)."
msgstr ""
"En %1 no hay con qué mostrar fondos de pantalla animados: tanto swww como "
"mpvpaper dibujan su propia ventana mediante wlr-layer-shell, que esta shell "
"no tiene. Allí los fondos de pantalla animados los muestra la extensión de "
"la shell: elige un fondo de pantalla en formato de vídeo (MP4/WebM)."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/wallpaper_engine.rs
msgid "GIF wallpaper started"
msgstr "Fondo de pantalla GIF iniciado"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/wallpaper_engine.rs
#: rust/rexon-gui/src/settings_actions.rs
msgid "Neither swww nor mpvpaper is installed for GIF wallpapers on Wayland"
msgstr ""
"Para los fondos de pantalla GIF en Wayland no está instalado ni swww ni "
"mpvpaper"

#. TRANSLATORS: %1 is a hint on how to install mpvpaper.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/wallpaper_engine.rs
msgid ""
"The mpvpaper program wasn't found; video wallpapers can't run on Wayland "
"without it. %1"
msgstr ""
"No se ha encontrado el programa mpvpaper; sin él, los fondos de pantalla de "
"vídeo no pueden funcionar en Wayland. %1"

#. TRANSLATORS: %1 is a hint on how to install xwinwrap.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/wallpaper_engine.rs
msgid ""
"The xwinwrap program wasn't found; video wallpapers can't run on X11 without "
"it. %1"
msgstr ""
"No se ha encontrado el programa xwinwrap; sin él, los fondos de pantalla de "
"vídeo no pueden funcionar en X11. %1"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/wallpaper_engine.rs
msgid "Video wallpaper started"
msgstr "Fondo de pantalla de vídeo iniciado"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/wallpaper_engine.rs
msgid "mpv isn't installed."
msgstr "mpv no está instalado."

#. TRANSLATORS: %1 is the shell name (Noctalia, DankMaterialShell). “Wallpaper Engine” is the tab name, “Give Wallpaper to Rexon” the button on it.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/wallpaper_engine.rs
msgid ""
"The background is currently drawn by %1: the shell keeps its own full-screen "
"surface on the wallpaper layer, and Rexon's wallpaper would end up "
"underneath it. On the Wallpaper Engine tab, press “Give Wallpaper to Rexon”, "
"then apply the Rexon wallpaper again."
msgstr ""
"Ahora el fondo lo dibuja %1: la shell tiene su propia superficie a pantalla "
"completa en la capa del fondo de pantalla, y el fondo de pantalla de Rexon "
"quedaría debajo. En la pestaña «Wallpaper Engine», pulsa «Ceder el fondo de "
"pantalla a Rexon» y vuelve a aplicar el fondo de pantalla de Rexon."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/wallpaper_engine.rs
msgid ""
"The wallpaper was handed to the Rexon shell extension, but GNOME Shell "
"reports an error in the extension, so the wallpaper won't appear. Log out "
"and back in; if that doesn't help, reinstall Rexon."
msgstr ""
"El fondo de pantalla se ha pasado a la extensión de la shell de Rexon, pero "
"GNOME Shell informa de un error en la extensión, así que el fondo de "
"pantalla no aparecerá. Cierra la sesión y vuelve a iniciarla; si no "
"funciona, reinstala Rexon."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/wallpaper_engine.rs
msgid ""
"The wallpaper was handed to the Rexon shell extension, but GNOME Shell "
"considers it incompatible with this shell version and doesn't load it. "
"Update Rexon."
msgstr ""
"El fondo de pantalla se ha pasado a la extensión de la shell de Rexon, pero "
"GNOME Shell la considera incompatible con su versión y no la carga. "
"Actualiza Rexon."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/wallpaper_engine.rs
msgid ""
"The wallpaper was handed to the Rexon shell extension, but the shell hasn't "
"loaded the extension yet. Log out and back in — the wallpaper will appear "
"after that."
msgstr ""
"El fondo de pantalla se ha pasado a la extensión de la shell de Rexon, pero "
"la shell todavía no ha cargado la extensión. Cierra la sesión y vuelve a "
"iniciarla; después aparecerá el fondo de pantalla."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/wallpaper_engine.rs
msgid ""
"The wallpaper was handed to the Rexon shell extension, but the shell didn't "
"say whether the extension is working. If the wallpaper doesn't appear, turn "
"on “Rexon Wallpaper Engine” in the extension list or log out and back in."
msgstr ""
"El fondo de pantalla se ha pasado a la extensión de la shell de Rexon, pero "
"la shell no ha indicado si la extensión funciona. Si el fondo de pantalla no "
"aparece, activa «Rexon Wallpaper Engine» en la lista de extensiones o cierra "
"la sesión y vuelve a iniciarla."

#. TRANSLATORS: %1 is the desktop name (GNOME, Cinnamon).
#: rust/rexon-core/src/wallpaper_engine.rs
msgid "Video wallpaper started (%1, shell extension)"
msgstr "Fondo de pantalla de vídeo iniciado (%1, extensión de la shell)"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/wallpaper_engine.rs
msgid "Flash wallpaper started (%1, shell extension)"
msgstr "Fondo de pantalla Flash iniciado (%1, extensión de la shell)"

#. TRANSLATORS: %1 is a desktop id (gnome, cinnamon); %2 is the
#. place in Rexon, e.g. “Appearance → GNOME Extensions”.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/wallpaper_engine.rs
msgid ""
"Live wallpapers on %1 need the Rexon shell extension: it's installed "
"together with the program — turn it on in “%2” and try again."
msgstr ""
"Los fondos de pantalla animados en %1 necesitan la extensión de la shell de "
"Rexon: se instala junto con el programa; actívala en «%2» y vuelve a "
"intentarlo."

#. TRANSLATORS: %1 is the place in Rexon, e.g. “Appearance → GNOME Extensions”.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/wallpaper_engine.rs
msgid ""
"The Rexon shell extension is left over from an older version and doesn't "
"know how to start the wallpaper. Reinstall it in “%1” and try again."
msgstr ""
"La extensión de la shell de Rexon es de una versión anterior y no sabe cómo "
"iniciar el fondo de pantalla. Reinstálala en «%1» y vuelve a intentarlo."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/wallpaper_engine.rs
msgid ""
"The wallpaper was handed to the shell extension, but the extension itself is "
"turned off — turn on “Rexon Wallpaper Engine” in the extension list."
msgstr ""
"El fondo de pantalla se ha pasado a la extensión de la shell, pero la propia "
"extensión está desactivada: activa «Rexon Wallpaper Engine» en la lista de "
"extensiones."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/wallpaper_engine.rs
msgid ""
"There's nothing to show live wallpapers with: the rexon-wallpaper-host "
"program wasn't found. It's installed together with Rexon — reinstall Rexon. "
"If you work from the source tree, build it: cargo build --release -p rexon-"
"gui."
msgstr ""
"No hay con qué mostrar fondos de pantalla animados: no se ha encontrado el "
"programa rexon-wallpaper-host. Se instala junto con Rexon: reinstala Rexon. "
"Si trabajas con el árbol de código fuente, compílalo: cargo build --release "
"-p rexon-gui."

#. TRANSLATORS: %1 is a file name.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/wallpaper_engine.rs
msgid "Video wallpaper started: %1"
msgstr "Fondo de pantalla de vídeo iniciado: %1"

#. TRANSLATORS: keep {stderr} as is: the program replaces it with the error output.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/wallpaper_engine.rs
#, rust-format
msgid "Couldn't start video_wallpaper: {stderr}"
msgstr "No se ha podido iniciar video_wallpaper: {stderr}"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/wallpaper_engine.rs
msgid ""
"On %1 live wallpapers are shown by the shell extension, and it needs a file "
"on disk — the video was downloaded instead of streamed."
msgstr ""
"En %1 los fondos de pantalla animados los muestra la extensión de la shell, "
"que necesita un archivo en el disco: el vídeo se ha descargado en lugar de "
"reproducirse en streaming."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/wallpaper_engine.rs
msgid ""
"On %1 a YouTube video can't be streamed: wallpapers there are shown by the "
"shell extension, and it needs a file on disk. Choose the “download” mode."
msgstr ""
"En %1 no se puede reproducir en streaming un vídeo de YouTube: allí los "
"fondos de pantalla los muestra la extensión de la shell, que necesita un "
"archivo en el disco. Elige el modo «descargar»."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/wallpaper_engine.rs
msgid "YouTube wallpaper started"
msgstr "Fondo de pantalla de YouTube iniciado"

#. TRANSLATORS: keep {stderr} as is: the program replaces it with the error output.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/wallpaper_engine.rs
#, rust-format
msgid "mpvpaper error: {stderr}"
msgstr "Error de mpvpaper: {stderr}"

#. TRANSLATORS: keep {stderr} as is: the program replaces it with the error output.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/wallpaper_engine.rs
#, rust-format
msgid "xwinwrap error: {stderr}"
msgstr "Error de xwinwrap: {stderr}"

#. TRANSLATORS: %1 is a hint on how to install yt-dlp.
#: rust/rexon-core/src/wallpaper_engine.rs
msgid ""
"The yt-dlp program wasn't found; YouTube videos can't be downloaded without "
"it. %1"
msgstr ""
"No se ha encontrado el programa yt-dlp; sin él no se pueden descargar vídeos "
"de YouTube. %1"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/wallpaper_engine.rs
msgid "Unsupported URL: %1"
msgstr "URL no compatible: %1"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/wallpaper_engine.rs
msgid ""
"Couldn't download the YouTube video. Try another quality or the streaming "
"mode."
msgstr ""
"No se ha podido descargar el vídeo de YouTube. Prueba con otra calidad o con "
"el modo streaming."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/wallpaper_engine.rs
msgid ""
"Couldn't download the YouTube video. Try another quality or another link: on "
"%1 the video can't be streamed — wallpapers there are shown by the shell "
"extension, and it needs a file on disk."
msgstr ""
"No se ha podido descargar el vídeo de YouTube. Prueba con otra calidad o con "
"otro enlace: en %1 el vídeo no se puede reproducir en streaming, porque allí "
