#: rust/rexon-core/src/we_window.rs
#, rust-format
msgid ""
"The Wallpaper Engine interface components were built for Qt {built}, but the "
"system now runs Qt {running}. They are not loaded, so the tab does not "
"crash.\n"
"\n"
"Update or reinstall Rexon so they are rebuilt for the new Qt version, then "
"restart Rexon."
msgstr ""
"Los componentes de la interfaz de la pestaña Wallpaper Engine se compilaron "
"para Qt {built}, pero el sistema usa ahora Qt {running}. No se cargan para "
"que la pestaña no se bloquee.\n"
"\n"
"Actualiza o reinstala Rexon (los componentes se volverán a compilar para la "
"nueva versión de Qt) y reinicia Rexon."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/we_window.rs
msgid ""
"The interface QML modules are not built.\n"
"\n"
"Build them and restart Rexon:\n"
"bash tools/build_qml_material.sh\n"
"bash tools/build_qml_control.sh"
msgstr ""
"Los módulos QML de la interfaz no están compilados.\n"
"\n"
"Compílalos y reinicia Rexon:\n"
"bash tools/build_qml_material.sh\n"
"bash tools/build_qml_control.sh"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/we_window.rs
msgid ""
"The waywallen wallpaper engine is missing.\n"
"\n"
"The Rexon package installs it as a separate system package, waywallen, but "
"its file is not in place. Reinstall the waywallen package, and wallpapers "
"will work."
msgstr ""
"Falta el motor de fondos de pantalla waywallen.\n"
"\n"
"El paquete de Rexon lo instala como paquete del sistema independiente, "
"waywallen, pero el archivo del motor no está en su sitio. Reinstala el "
"paquete waywallen y los fondos de pantalla funcionarán."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/we_window.rs
msgid ""
"The waywallen wallpaper engine is not installed.\n"
"\n"
"This copy of Rexon was installed without the engine. Install Rexon from its "
"package — the engine comes with it — and wallpapers will work."
msgstr ""
"El motor de fondos de pantalla waywallen no está instalado.\n"
"\n"
"Esta copia de Rexon se instaló sin el motor. Instala Rexon desde su paquete "
"(el motor viene incluido) y los fondos de pantalla funcionarán."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/we_window.rs
msgid ""
"The waywallen wallpaper engine does not start.\n"
"\n"
"Press “Retry Start”. If that does not help, reinstall the waywallen package: "
"the engine file may be damaged."
msgstr ""
"El motor de fondos de pantalla waywallen no se inicia.\n"
"\n"
"Pulsa «Reintentar el inicio». Si no funciona, reinstala el paquete "
"waywallen: el archivo del motor puede estar dañado."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/we_window.rs
msgid ""
"The waywallen wallpaper engine does not start.\n"
"\n"
"Press “Retry Start”. If that does not help, restart the computer; the "
"details are in the Rexon log."
msgstr ""
"El motor de fondos de pantalla waywallen no se inicia.\n"
"\n"
"Pulsa «Reintentar el inicio». Si no funciona, reinicia el equipo; los "
"detalles están en el registro de Rexon."

