#: rust/rexon-core/src/window_menu.rs
msgid "Desktop environment manager for Linux"
msgstr "Gestor de entornos de escritorio para Linux"

#: rust/rexon-core/src/window_menu.rs
msgid ""
"Install, remove and configure desktop environments, themes, icons, cursors, "
"fonts, wallpapers (including Wallpaper&nbsp;Engine), the login screen and "
"boot splash (SDDM/Plymouth), widgets and extensions — all in one place."
msgstr ""
"Instala, desinstala y configura entornos de escritorio, temas, iconos, "
"cursores, tipos de letra, fondos de pantalla (incluido "
"Wallpaper&nbsp;Engine), la pantalla de inicio de sesión y la pantalla de "
"arranque (SDDM/Plymouth), widgets y extensiones, todo en una sola ventana."

#: rust/rexon-core/src/window_menu.rs
msgid ""
"<b>Supported:</b> KDE, GNOME, Cinnamon, XFCE, MATE, Budgie, Pantheon, "
"Deepin, LXQt, COSMIC, Wayfire, Hyprland, sway, niri, River"
msgstr ""
"<b>Compatible con:</b> KDE, GNOME, Cinnamon, XFCE, MATE, Budgie, Pantheon, "
"Deepin, LXQt, COSMIC, Wayfire, Hyprland, sway, niri, River"

